Xinhua Times Review: Build outstanding returning migrant workers into a force for rural revitalization - Xinhua Network
In rural revitalization, talent is the key.
Where to find people?
Excellent returning migrant workers is an indispensable force.
Xinhua News Agency Shang Haichun
Xinhua News Agency, Chengdu, July 26th: Turning outstanding returning migrant workers into a vitality force for rural rejuvenation
The 34-year-old Zhang Xiong’s family is in Meishan City, Sichuan Province, and in 2010, he returned to his hometown to start a business with a monthly salary of tens of thousands.
After several years of hard work, the annual income of the grape-growing family farm he runs is now more than one million yuan, and he has become a well-known rich leader, and has also been selected to enter the "two committees" team in the village.
In recent years, under the inspiration of a series of supporting agricultural policies such as national poverty alleviation and rural revitalization, more and more outstanding migrant workers like Zhang Xiong have chosen to return to their hometowns to start businesses, activating the spring water in the countryside.
China's western populous provinces, labor-exporting province of Sichuan, due to snobbish to guide the implementation of "excellent migrant workers return training project", only in 2019, from the return of outstanding migrant workers to produce more than 8,000 village party branch secretaries, the cultivation of village reserve force of 61,000, the development of more than 20,000 party members, in order to win the battle against poverty and the implementation of rural revitalization strategy to provide a strong guarantee.
It’s not good, it’s important to look at the fellows.
Since the reform and opening up, a large number of young and middle-aged laborers in rural China have increased their income, and some have created their own enterprises through hard work.
However, objectively, it has also led to the emergence of rural "hollowing" to varying degrees, especially the weakening of rural grass-roots organizations, and the village party branch secretaries and party members have shown the characteristics of "one old and one low", that is, aging age, low education, the leader of the village party organization is not strong, and the problem is prominent.
If factors such as rural talents have been flowing one-way to the city, the countryside has long been in a state of "blood loss" and "anaemia", and revitalization is an empty phrase.
To attract migrant workers who are capable, conscious, and interested in serving their hometowns, to guide them to return to their hometowns and become rich leaders, to cultivate party members and rural cadres, and to enrich grass-roots cadres, which is the solution to solve the management of rural party members and grass-roots party organizations.
Excellent migrant workers can lead back, but also let them stay and do a good job.
In recent years, Sichuan began by paying close attention to the construction of the Peasant Labor Party, on the basis of strict selection criteria, establishing institutional mechanisms such as forward-oriented return of outstanding migrant workers, service guarantee, training ability, and selection and use, so that they can improve their ability, have safety in their work, have expectations in their lives, and truly take root in rural areas, and have a sense of accomplishment in entrepreneurship.
This year is the closing year of the decisive battle against poverty, and to do a good job in linking poverty alleviation with rural revitalization, talent is the key factor.
Party committees and governments at all levels should attach great importance to this group of outstanding returning migrant workers, through comprehensive measures, build them into a task force that can stay, can fight, take away, and provide strong organizational support and talent support for rural poverty alleviation and well-off development and revitalization.
Because of the epidemic, this year's college graduates are a very special session, on the evening of July 11st, bilibili summer graduation song will bring a special online live performance for graduates, old wolves, simple trees, Li Yuchun, Mao and other musicians sent songs and blessings to recent graduates.
The well-known owner, SealWu Wu Yifan, also brought a "weeds", which is his rap song based on Lu Xun's collection of essay poetry of the same name, which is extremely popular among young people.
Due to the relationship between the epidemic, many graduates have not been able to experience the sense of ceremony of dialing ears on the spot and obtaining diplomas, and they have transferred the sense of ceremony to the line.
According to the data, this 2.5-hour concert, the peak popularity of live broadcasting exceeded 35 million.
"Follow your own heart, seize the opportunity, regardless of the consequences, and sometimes there will be unexpected gains."
Although it is a graduation concert, many songs have also moved non-new graduates.
"The whole scene really wants to cry, whose youth is full of beauty and regret, but it is worth nostalgizing, we must be brave to go on."
Beijing's natural ecology continues to improve, attracting more than 500 kinds of wild animal cities "settlement"-Zhongxin.com
2020-07-26 05:03:17 Source: Beijing Youth Daily Author:Wang Sishuo Responsibility Editor:Wang Sisuo
The capital's natural ecology continues to improve, attracting wildlife cities to "settlement"
There are more than 500 species of wild animals in Beijing.
This newspaper (Reporter Wang Bin) Beijing Youth Daily reporter learned from the Municipal Landscaping Bureau that in recent years, with the continuous improvement of the natural ecological environment of the capital, the types and numbers of wild animals have also continued to increase.
At present, the number of terrestrial vertebrate wildlife living in Beijing has been increased to more than 500 species, including state-level protected animals such as brown horse chickens and black storks, as well as second-class protected animals such as antelopes, large swans, gray cranes, and ducks.
Whether it is an urban forest planted in the second ring, or a small micro-wetland embedded between the buildings, it not only brings the wild interest of nature to the citizens of the capital, but also attracts wild animals to "settlement" in the city.
In the middle of summer, it is located in Songshan National Nature Reserve in the Yanshan Mountains in the northwest of Yanqing District.
One of them played leisurely next to the mountains, while the two dog badgers quarreled with each other.
Looking back, a wild boar can't help but scratch its body is rubbing its bark. Hu Qiaoli, director of the Songshan National Nature Reserve Management Department, introduced that as of the end of 2019, in this green sea with a total area of more than 6,200 hectares, there are 178 kinds of wild animals, including the state-level protection of animal golden carvings and the national second-level protection of spoon chickens and flamboo, and nearly one-third of the city's wildlife species can be found here.
"In Songshan, wild animals are the real 'masters', and our staff can only be regarded as people's bodyguards at best."
In order to understand the situation of wildlife in protected areas on the ground, there are more than 30 professional rangers every day, patrolling along 16 carefully formulated protection routes, and there will be a "big circle" every month, and spend almost a whole day walking through the entire protected area.
“During the inspection, it is not only necessary to check the recording of biodiversity, but also to check the installation of artificial bird's nests, the rescue of injured wild animals, the installation of infrared cameras in the field, and so on."
Songshan National Nature Reserve has installed more than 200 infrared cameras to record the living conditions of wild animals in the forest.
Hu Qiaoli introduced that with the continuous enrichment of biodiversity in protected areas in recent years, more and more wild animals have appeared in the lens, leopard cats, squirrels and porks have become "resident guests", and the "appearance rate" of the national secondary protection of animals is getting higher and higher.
Zhang Zhiming, director of the wildlife and wetland protection department of the Beijing Municipal Bureau of Landscaping, said that Beijing's terrestrial vertebrates have increased from 461 species in 1994 to more than 500, and Beijing's wildlife species and numbers have continued to increase in recent years.
The presence of wild animals in cities has become more and more common, which is closely related to the continuous upgrading of urban greening in the capital in recent years.
In particular, a new round of one million acres of afforestation and greening construction began in 2018 proposes to reshape the urban ecological environment, improve the ecological function of forest green spaces, and highlight the concept of “near nature”.
It is planned to achieve interconnected interaction with the surrounding green areas, so as to facilitate wild animals to "visit relatives and friends", and planting trees are also the favorite sources of honey and food plants for animals.
Black land "seeding" agricultural modernization - Xinhua
Xinhua News Agency, Harbin, July 26th: Black land "planted" agricultural modernization
In the middle of summer, two spraying pharmaceutical planes skimmed through the 10,000-acre high-yield demonstration field of the second operating station of the Fifth Management Zone of the Friendship Farm, forming two white lines, and the "first game in the world" with black rice seedlings in the green field was particularly eye-catching.
The operating station director Kong Lingqiang said that this aircraft can spray more than 6,000 acres of arable land every day, which is about 8 times the efficiency of drones and hundreds of times that of labor.
This farm is located in Heilongjiang Province, China's first grain-producing province in Friendship County, from the past "wow" rice cutting sound through to today's "rumbling" motor sound, Chinese traditional farming and farms in this black soil belt to achieve transformation.
In addition to airplanes, satellites have also been used in modern agricultural production on Friendship Farms.
On the one hand, they use satellite remote sensing technology to achieve accurate fertilization, reduce agricultural inputs, and reduce pollution; on the other hand, satellite navigation technology can improve the level of standardized operation of agricultural machinery in the field.
In this year's rice production process, the farm has expanded the operating area of satellite navigation unmanned interpolation technology from 3,000 acres last year to 30,000 acres.
This technology makes seedling planting more even, which can maximize the utilization of sunlight and arable land resources, and can also save 16 yuan per acure of labor costs.
Farms have experimented with new technologies such as informatization and intelligence in agricultural production, forming the largest agricultural machinery group in China from the ground to the sky.
According to statistics, at present, there are 49,000 units (pieces) of agricultural machinery on farms, and the comprehensive mechanization rate in the field has reached 99.8%.
Agricultural machinery operations to achieve GPS satellite navigation 100%, dry field precision sowing 100%, dry field high horsepower locomotive operation 100%.
"Green agriculture, smart agriculture, digital agriculture is the direction of agricultural modernization."
Liu Hualian, director of the Friendship Farm, said.
The key to agricultural modernization lies in scientific and technological progress.
In recent years, Heilongjiang agricultural reclamation represented by farms has played a demonstration and leading role in modern large-scale agricultural "carriers", and initially established a modern agricultural industrial system dominated by large-scale planting, standardized production, and industrialization management.
On the outskirts of Friendship County, there is a 350,000-square-square-meter agricultural machinery exposition park.
More than 140 (pieces) of agricultural machinery have been introduced and used in Heilongjiang agricultural reclamation for many years.
These agricultural tools and farms have witnessed the development of China's agricultural modernization.
She small family for everyone - Anhui Hefei Jiangyuhe joint crowd transfer direct attack-Xinhua.com
Xinhua News Agency, Hefei, July 26th: She Xiaojia for everyone - Anhui Hefei Jiangkou River joint crowd transfer direct attack
Xinhua News Agency reporters Chen Shanying, Wang Liwu, Liu Xiacun
At more than 4 p.m. on July 25, Fu Kunbao, dressed in glue shoes full of mud, went to the back house from the former house, and his wife Zhou Yan was busy picking up things back and forth.
“When I received a call from the village cadres for the transfer, I was still in the field.”
Fu Kunbao said that he transferred more than 60 acres of land, planted rice, the current growth is good, "Yesterday also hit the medicine, the tools have not cleaned up."
Fu Kunbao pointed to the pesticide sprayer placed in the corner, "no one wants to be flooded at his home, home for everyone."
In order to cope with the continuous high water level pressure and possible heavy rainfall in Chaohu Lake, Hefei City, Anhui Province, is ready to launch the Jiangkou River, where Fu Kunbaojia is located, on the 26th.
It is located in Feixi County, close to the Chaohu embankment.
There are thousands of villagers involved in Yandian Township and Sanhe Town that need to be transferred.
As of 16:00 on the 25th, China's fifth largest freshwater lake water level is still maintained at a high level of 13.2 meters, exceeding the guaranteed water level of 0.7 meters.
Fu Kunbao's kitchen was cleaned up, and there was a basin of pumpkin head dishes on the table, and there were eggs and some halogen dishes in the refrigerator.
"I didn't expect to move, the water of the Jiangkou River is still good."
Zhou Yan said that the home is a bungalow, and some large objects have not yet thought about where to put it.
"First of all, you can pack up your valuables, refrigerators and TVs, which can be temporarily placed in the homes of neighbors or relatives with high ground."
The village cadre Wang Lizheng gave Fu Kunbao an idea.
Wang Lizheng was responsible for the transfer and resettlement of 13 villagers, and one family and one family were notified to confirm everyone's resettlement plan.
The nearest settlement from Fu Kunbao is Yandian Township Su Primary School, about 2 kilometers away.
In addition to the big pieces, Fu Kunbao's headache is more than 1,000 pounds of food and some newly purchased furniture at home.
"The food is ready to be dragged to relatives, and the furniture can't be moved."
As soon as the husband and wife discussed, they put a stool on the cushion under the newly purchased bed and raised the bed by about half a meter.
At 6 p.m., Fu Kunbao began to use a tricycle to transport things to his relatives' homes, and Zhou Yan continued to pack things at home.
At more than 11 p.m., the couple looked back and forth at home before and after, pulled up the electric gate, ready to go to the settlement.
“I hope the water goes out sooner.”
Fu Kunbao said.
At 9:30 a.m. on July 26, the reporter saw at the scene of the Jiangkou River that the local government had made preparations before the flooding.
Zhang Jikolin's small house team is full of muscle youth-Xinhua network
"Sports Bar Youth" officially landed on Hunan Satellite TV on July 11.
Sports leader Zhang Jike and sports assistant Lin Xiaojiao across the platform, Lin Dan and Fu Yuanhui commented that there are different styles, and the "behemoth"-like power plucking rod device's hard-core on the field, but also let the program "ignition" is full of strength.
In the first episode, 11 sports teenagers appeared on the power track, and at the same time, the "strong conflict", "strong confrontation" and "strong heart" on the competitive stage were also concerned.
Among them, "strong conflict" comes from the super A sports student Qiao Wenyi, before the race openly provoked in the same track with Xu Zhibin, known as "Beautiful man", choking Xu Zhibin's appearance conditions should sing and dance the program, and even let out the "lose don't wear makeup and spend" tough words.
Some words let the teenagers and sports leaders on the field take a cold breath.
"Strong confrontation" is more like a fairy fight, known as the "big demon king" Sun Jianqi encountered the same strength of Zhang Xindong, staged a strong showdown.
And their identity is also unexpected, Sun Jianqi is an actor who loves fitness, Zhang Xindong is a retired special combat team member, the winner of the Order of the Warrior three times.
At the beginning of the game, the two teenagers did their best to quickly pull out the small pole, and the long-lasting confrontation on the big pole allowed the audience to pinch a sweat for them.
In the tense situation, Zhang Jike, as one of the sports leaders of "Sport Bar Youth", is also watching the battle seriously.
In the review session, he is also very careful, patiently encouraging the young people who lost the game, and helping every mistake point in the recovery process.
The sports assistant Lin Xiaojiao is a fancy assist, and she makes no secret of her appreciation of the face value strength of online teenagers.
When it comes to understanding the daily training of sports boys, they are even more admirable.
Lin Dan and Fu Yuanhui, who are also sports leaders, have their own styles, one is a "suppherist" who is angry, and the other is the "red girl" who dispels the tense atmosphere with a smile.
In addition, Jike and Liu Ye, as sports assistants, have also created a lot of funny topics around sports teenagers.
France's Nantes church fire: parish volunteers admit to arsonatism
According to foreign media reports, on July 18th, the religious and historical buildings of Nantes, France, the famous St. Peter and St Paul's Cathedral, were severely damaged in a fire, and the large organ was completely destroyed.
On the 26th local time, Nantes prosecutors announced that a diocesan volunteer in charge of defending the cathedral had been charged with "arson destruction".
He admitted that he had lit a fire in the church.
According to the report, the local prosecutor Senas said that the 39-year-old diocese volunteer, from Rwanda, admitted that he ignited three places in the cathedral at night.
The man’s lawyer said the arsonists now regretted doing so.
A few years ago, he entered France by means of asylum, was sheltered in the diocese where the fire occurred, and was taken in the church.
According to the prosecution, he has recently tried to renew his visa and is engaged in dialogue with the police.
However, the church said that it still can't believe that this believer, who is usually very kind and smiling, but does not talk much, will destroy the church that he loves so much.
On the day of the July 18 fire, the volunteer had already been questioned by the police because of the logical problems in the narrative, but he was later released.
Firefighters are at the scene for rescue.
On the evening of the 25th, due to the professional engineers of the laboratory of the Central Police in Paris obtained new evidence, this person was summoned again.
This time, the man admitted to his arson.
According to reports, the suspect could face 10 years in prison and a fine of 150,000 euros if convicted of intentional arson destruction.
According to reports, the fire caused serious damage to St. Pierre and St Paul's Cathedral, the organ inside the church was completely destroyed, and the stained glass windows behind the organ were also severely damaged.
Brunet, the chief architect of French historical preservation buildings, believes that it is conservatively estimated that the restoration of Nantes Cathedral will take at least three years.
Comprehensive news: U.S. unilateralism undermines bilateral relations International public opinion supports China's countermeasures against the United States
BEIJING, July 26 (Xinhua) -- On the morning of July 24, the Chinese Foreign Ministry notified the U.S. Embassy in China that China had decided to revoke its permission for the establishment and operation of the U.S. Consulate General in Chengdu, and put forward specific requirements for the Consulate General to stop all operations and activities.
International public opinion believes that the unilateral measures taken by the United States have caused serious problems in China-US relations, and China has responded to unreasonable provocations by the United States, and it is justified and necessary to take countermeasures.
Andres Borks, director of the China Research Center at the Institute of International Studies at the University of Chile, said that the unilateralist measures of the United States have damaged the bridge of understanding between the two peoples and caused a crisis in the relationship between the two major powers.
China's notification of the United States to close its consulate in Chengdu is a countermeasure to unilateral measures by the United States, which is in line with diplomatic practice.
Patricio Justo, a professor at the Catholic University of Argentina and director of the central center of Argentina-China Studies, believes that China's above-mentioned decision is a legitimate and necessary counter-measure against the previous provocation by the United States, and is not aimed at the ordinary American people.
The United States is trying to divert the attention of the American people by putting pressure on China to cover up its weak response to the new crown epidemic.
Bambang Suryono, chairman of the Asian Innovation Research Center, an Indonesian think tank, said that the United States has taken a provocative diplomatic posture, which has caused serious problems in China-US relations and faced serious challenges in bilateral relations.
China's notification to the United States that the closure of its consulate in Chengdu is a normal counter-measure, in line with diplomatic practice, which reflects China's principled position of resolutely safeguarding its own interests, as well as China's reasonable and favorable diplomatic relations.
Tanzanian commentator Francis Semwenza said that China's above-mentioned decision is a legitimate and necessary response to the provocations made by the United States.
China-U.S. relations should return to normal, and the U.S. side should take the initiative to improve relations with China and stop interfering in China's internal affairs.
The United States should focus on how to achieve win-win economic and political results with China and how it can benefit the two peoples and the international community as a whole.
Ali Yusuf, executive director of the Sudan-based Federation of Arab-Chinese Friendship Associations, said that China's forced countermeasures are a legitimate and necessary response to the unreasonable actions of the United States, in line with international law and the basic norms of international relations, and in line with diplomatic practices.
Earlier, the United States called for the closure of the Chinese Consulate General in Houston to seriously violate international law and basic norms governing international relations.
It is hoped that the United States will rescind the previous relevant decisions and create the necessary conditions for the normalization of bilateral relations.
Singapore's "Joint Morning Post" published an editorial saying that the greater strategic intention of the United States is to contain China and prevent China's continued rise.
In the face of the United States, although China is very reluctant to see that China-US relations continue to deteriorate, it has had to take countermeasures.
(Participating journalists: Yin Nan, Zhang Xiaoran, Nin Ruijie, Liang Hui, Gao Zhu, Lisbo, Ma Yizhen, Wang Lili)
Xinhua News Agency, Guangzhou, July 26 (Reporter Mao Xin) The reporter learned from the Guangdong Coast Guard Bureau that recently, in conjunction with the Guangzhou customs and public security departments of Guangzhou, the bureau knocked down a large smuggled refined oil gang, and initially verified that the gang had smuggled about 120,000 tons of refined oil since 2019, with a value of about 800 million yuan and about 240 million yuan in tax evasion.
The Guangdong Coast Guard and the anti-smuggling department of the customs have gradually identified the division of personnel and organizational structure of the gang.
On July 8, the coastal police, customs, and public security departments carried out a unified network collection operation in Guangzhou, Foshan and other places, as well as in the waters of the mouth of the Pearl River, seized four suspected smuggling ships on the spot, seized a total of 4,700 tons of refined oil from ships and oil reservoirs, and froze a number of capital accounts.
It is understood that this joint operation dispatched a total of 8 ships and 2 helicopters, divided into a number of action teams to fight together, and carried out full-chain strikes on maritime smuggling, land illegal operations and other links, and all 35 major criminal suspects came to the case.
The case is currently under further investigation.
The relevant person in charge of the Guangdong Coast Guard Bureau said that in the future, it will continue to maintain a high-pressure situation, crack down on all kinds of illegal and criminal smuggling at sea, and maintain good order in the waters under its jurisdiction.
Hurricane "Hannah" made landfall in the United States or caused river surges and flash floods.
Comprehensive foreign media reported that at 5 p.m. local time on the 25th, Hurricane "Hanna" made landfall in Texas in the United States, which will bring strong storms and rain to Texas, and the sharp rise of the river, which may also lead to life-threatening flash floods.
According to the National Hurricane Center, it is expected that Hurricane Hanna will take heavy rains, sweep through parts of the southern and north-eastern regions of the state, and that the rain may cause some streams to skyrocket and life-threatening flash floods.
The worst affected by Hurricane Hanna was south of Corpus Christi to the estuary of the Rio Grande River, while the Rio Grande Valley could erupt a wide range of flash floods.
Texas Premier Abbott said: "Any hurricane is a huge challenge."
Thirty-two counties in the state are in a state of emergency because of the hurricane.
The city of Corpus Christi, with a population of more than 320,000, has closed its libraries and museums, with residents waiting.
Abbott also said that at a time when Texas is being hit hard by the new crown epidemic, it can no longer allow the hurricane to bring more casualties to Texas.
Precipitation in southern Texas is expected to reach 6 to 12 inches on the night of the 26th, and 3 to 5 inches of rain will also occur in northern Texas and the coastal areas of Louisiana.
Due to factors such as global warming, "Hanna" formed earlier than previous Atlantic hurricane seasons.
In general, the first hurricanes in the Atlantic usually don’t form until mid-August.
Poland withdraws from European treaty to prevent violence against women
Poland's Ministry of Justice said on Saturday it would take steps next week to withdraw from the European treaty on the prevention of violence against women.
Poland's right-wing government cabinet said the treaty required schools to teach students about gender issues and trampled on the rights of their parents.
Poland's Justice Minister Jioblow told a news conference that his Ministry of Justice would ask the Ministry of Labour and Family Monday to begin withdrawing from the treaty.
It is also known as the Istanbul Convention.
“The treaty contains elements of what we consider to be harmful morphological properties.”
Poland’s ruling Law and Justice Party, together with its governing coalition partners, has a close alliance with the Roman Catholic Church and promotes a conservative social agenda.
Poland’s President Duda made hostility to gay rights one of the main issues during his successful re-election campaign this month.
On Friday, tens of thousands of Poles, most of them women, staged protests in Warsaw and a number of other cities against withdrawing from the convention.
One of the organizers of the protests, Lempat, said in a protest march in Warsaw that “the purpose of withdrawing from the treaty is to legalize domestic violence.”
Some of the protesters held banners that read, “The Law and Justice Party is women’s hell.”
The Law and Justice Party has long complained about the Istanbul Convention.
Poland’s former centrist government ratified the convention in 2015.
The Law and Justice party government said that the treaty does not respect religion and calls for liberal social policies to be taught in schools.
However, so far, the party has not decided to withdraw from the convention.
(According to Reuters)
Brazil's President's new coronavirus test results turn negative - Xinhua
Brasilia, July 25 (Reporter Zhou Xingzhu) Brazilian President Bolsonaro announced on his personal social media account on the 25th that his latest new coronavirus test results were negative.
In addition to the release of the latest test results, Bolsonaro also posted a photo of himself holding a hydroxychloroquine box on social media.
Bolsonaro has always insisted that the drug can be effective in treating the new coronavirus infection, and has repeatedly shown that he is taking the drug through social media live broadcasts.
According to Brazilian media reports, Bolsonaro announced on the same day the results of the virus after driving a motorcycle, went to the capital Brasiliado, but also met with a member of Congress.
Bolsonaro has previously been quarantined at the president’s residence.
Bolsonaro announced in a joint live broadcast by a number of local media on the 7th of this month that he tested positive for the new coronavirus on the 6th, and conducted two more tests on the 14th and 21st, and the results were positive.
Jiangxi opens up "green channel" for young people in the first line of flood resistance - Xinhua
Xinhua News Agency, Nanchang, July 26 (Guo Dongming, Xing Liang) Jiangxi Provincial People's Government Conscription Office recently made it clear that for individuals or their children who have performed well in this flood relief and disaster relief task, they meet the recruitment conditions, and the physical examination and political assessment are both qualified.
“After the registration of young candidates, we will give priority to soldiers after verification by the community where the youth candidates are located, the street armed forces department and the conscription office in Xunyang District.”
Wang Hui, deputy minister of people's armed forces in Xunyang District of Jiujiang City, said that due to the impact of the floods, they began from the 25th and concentrated on three days to organize the recruitment of young people for medical examinations.
Jiujiang City, Xunyang District candidate Zhou Jingfan is a 22-year-old university graduate, his mother is a community worker, his father is a retired veteran of the Air Force Department, for more than a dozen days Zhou Jingfan's parents have been on duty in the first line of flood control.
"These days, in the news to see the people's children and soldiers desperate to defend their hometown in the line of resistance to floods, I also want to be like them."
Zhou Jingfan said that since he was a child, he had a military dream, and through this anti-flood, he strengthened his determination to join the barracks.
Jiujiang City also regards anti-flood rescue as the "living teaching material" of recruitment propaganda, and they take the community as the unit, calling on recruited young people to voluntarily participate in tasks such as patrolling the dyke, on duty, etc. Now they feel the nature and purpose of the people's army, and strengthen their confidence in joining the army and reporting to the country.
Luo Jiuyu, political commissar of the People's Armed Forces Department of Xunyang District of Jiujiang City, said that through the way of prioritizing soldiers, he hopes to inspire more young candidates and create a good social atmosphere that participates in the glorious task and participates in the glory of the army.
According to the Vietnam News Agency, Grivory believes that Vietnam has made great contributions to the development of ASEAN in the past 25 years.
Vietnam is not only a responsible member of ASEAN, but also a locomotive of ASEAN.
Grivory said that Russia and even the Asia-Europe Economic Union believe that Vietnam will contribute to ASEAN's improvement of its status and promote its image.
He stressed that “ASEAN should therefore be grateful to Vietnam.”
Grivoly said that analysts recognized Vietnam's peace initiative.
Vietnam is willing to share its experiences with ASEAN countries and propose constructive and peaceful measures to the problems facing the Asia-Pacific region, including the East Sea issue.
Regarding the cooperation between Vietnam and Russia under the ASEAN framework, Grivory believes that Vietnam provides support for the cooperation between Russia and ASEAN and helps Russia gain benefits under this cooperation framework.
The Asia-Europe Economic Union, including Russia, has been able to enter the ASEAN market after signing a free trade agreement with Vietnam.
Grivory proposed to maximize the Asian-European Economic Union and ASEAN countries' free trade areas, thereby creating a platform for economic security and stability.
At the same time, Grivory believes that Russia, Vietnam and ASEAN are on track and will achieve their goals.
From now until the end of 2020, Beijiang Province will have the necessary conditions, especially in terms of infrastructure, human resources and land, in order to take the initiative to usher in foreign investment inflows, especially multinational groups with value chains and the transfer of advanced technologies.
In addition, Beijiang Province will submit to the Prime Minister's decision to invest in infrastructure construction and business projects in the Vietnam-South Korea Industrial Zone and approve the inclusion of two industrial-city-service areas in Anshan-Beilong and Anyan in the province for inclusion in the overall plan for the development of Vietnam's industrial zones by 2020.
At the same time, Beijiang Province has made efforts to accelerate the progress of various projects, especially the infrastructure construction and operation projects of industrial park clusters such as Hefu, Gwangjou, Shuangxi-Neihuang, etc., to form a land fund for attracting investment.
In 2020, the Beijiang Provincial Bureau of Industry and Trade participated in providing suggestions and suggestions for the planning of designated industrial zones and industrial clusters to be included in the provincial planning.
Beijiang Province has determined to combine the development of industrial park clusters with the protection of national defense and security, the protection of the ecological environment, and the protection of food security, so as to promote the balanced development of the industry; with comprehensive electricity, water supply, transportation and telecommunications infrastructure, combined with urban construction, trade services, workers' housing and health care, education and other social infrastructure.
In the industrial zone, Beijiang Province focuses on investment projects on high-tech, cleaning technologies in the fields of power, electronics, telecommunications equipment, precision machinery, and auxiliary industry.
In the industrial park cluster, the province called for small and medium-scale investment projects in the fields of production and utilization of local labor, especially agricultural products and food processing.
In the future, Beijiang Province will focus on accelerating the investment in the infrastructure of the logistics center of Beijiang City, and the simultaneous development of industrial park clusters to optimize the circulation of goods and currencies and help to reduce production costs, increase the value of goods, optimize the supply chain, and develop multimodal transportation, so as to create attraction for investors to invest in the province.
Upgraded version of the Russian helicopter gunship card-52M at the end of the factory for the first time - Xinhua
MOSCOW, July 25 (Xinhua) -- According to the plan of the Russian Ministry of Defense, an upgraded version of the Russian armed helicopters (hereinafter referred to as Wuzhi) Ka-52: Ka-52M will complete the replacement and factory for the first time in December this year, and the model will be greatly improved in terms of reconnaissance, communication and weapons performance.
According to the Russian "News" recently reported that Wuzhika-52M is called "super all-kiss crocodile", its development contract was signed by the Russian military and military units in April last year, the first batch of two of the first batch of the upgraded version of Wuzhi is in the Russian "progress" aerospace company's Far East helicopter manufacturing plant to accept the transformation, its state-level testing and improvement work will end before October 2022.
It is understood that the Russian experts of the above-mentioned upgrading work introduced that the "seniors" of the "super alligator" - Wuzhika-52 was officially installed in November 2011, and the model exposed some weaknesses in use, and the transformation and upgrading was to "complement the shortcomings".
According to the report, compared with the Ka-52, the Ka-52M will partially use new protective materials that will not add weight, and its pilot cockpit will be reinforced and equipped with new equipment to resist missile attacks, thereby increasing the probability of survival in the battlefield; equipped with more powerful generators to power more complex airborne electronic equipment; the optoelectronic system can be upgraded, capable of detecting and identifying battlefield targets farther away; equipped with new light multi-role missiles with mainly attacking armored combat vehicles and reinforced concrete fortifications.
In addition, the Ka-52M will have more advanced electronic guidance systems, weapons targeting systems and navigation equipment.
Russian experts also said that it is noteworthy that the Ka-52M will be equipped with communication equipment to communicate with drones, so as to obtain information transmitted by nearby drones in the air in real time, such as showing images taken by drones on the cockpit screen of the helicopter.
According to the plan, the Ka-52M’s pilots will be able to directly control the drones they cooperate with, so as to improve the pilot's mastery of the battlefield situation and the guidance of long-range missiles.
According to Russian media reports, Russia's Deputy Defense Minister Krivoluchko said in December last year that the Russian Defense Ministry plans to purchase more than 110 Wuzhika-52M by 2027.
According to the new law, the Campania region must wear masks in indoor public places from now on, and violators are punishable by a fine of up to 1,000 euros.
On June 1st local time, the Colosseum reopened in Rome, the capital of Italy.
According to reports, according to the latest epidemic prevention decree issued by the regional government, people in Campania must wear masks in accordance with the requirements of epidemic prevention by taking all public transportation, as well as indoor public places such as shops, bars, supermarkets and pavilions.
Violation of this provision is punishable by a fine of up to 1,000 euros.
At the same time, the decree stipulates that all passengers from non-Schengan countries entering the Campania region must be quarantined.
The regional government will authorize health agencies to coordinate the arrangement of specific hotels for the isolation of positive asymptomatic people.
The decree came into force on July 25.
In less than an hour, three customers entering the supermarket have accepted the fine.
Hebei this year, the ecological replenishment of rivers and lakes 1.75 billion cubic meters
Xinhua News Agency, Shijiazhuang, July 26 (Reporter Wang Kun) The reporter learned from the Hebei Provincial Water Conservancy Department that since this year, Hebei Province has coordinated the use of guiding river water and local reservoir water, and successively implemented ecological hydration to 28 rivers such as the Zhandu River, the Tang River, and the Denima River, and the Baiyang Precipitation, with a total of 1.75 billion cubic meters.
Hebei Province has firmly grasped the favorable opportunity of the South-to-North Water Diversion Middle Line Project to increase the flow of water transmission, and implemented ecological hydration using the diversion of river water to Tanghe, Shahe, Lilong River and other rivers.
At the same time, ecological rehydration has been implemented using nine large and medium-sized reservoirs such as the Western Ocean and Dongwushi and the Baiyang Dian to the Liaoyang River and Qinglong River, with a cumulative surface area of more than 90 square kilometers.
In order to do a good job in ecological replenishment work, the Hebei Provincial Water Conservancy Department actively organizes the investigation, remediation and strengthening of the hidden dangers of rehydration rivers and the cleaning of rivers, refines practical measures, and strengthens inspection and management care.
Through supervision and inspection and centralized undercover visits, all kinds of problems can be solved in time to ensure the safe and orderly replenishment of rivers.
According to the relevant person in charge of the Hebei Provincial Water Conservancy Department, the orderly implementation of ecological replenishment of rivers and lakes has effectively restored the water ecological environment of Hebei Province, promoted the rehabilitation and conservation of groundwater along the coast, greatly improved the living environment and economic development environment along the route, and is of great significance to the realization of the goal of "clear water, green on the shore, smooth rivers, and beautiful scenery".
In the past two weeks, the number of new crown cases in Spain has rebounded sharply, with thousands of new cases in many days.
The British government temporarily decided on the evening of Saturday (July 25) to remove Spain from the safe travel list from 0:00 on the 26th local time, and those entering the United Kingdom from Spain must be quarantined for 14 days.
British tourists on holiday in Spain have been surprised, worried and even angry about the decision, because the news is sudden and unprepared.
Britain’s transport minister, Grant Shapps, is currently on holiday in Spain.
Before Britain issued the quarantine measures, Norway has also announced that people returning to Norway from Spain will be quarantined for 10 days.
France and Belgium have advised their residents to abandon their plans to take a vacation in front of Barcelona and surrounding areas.
The beaches in these areas are overcrowded and people are unable to maintain sociable distancing, and the police once needed to take steps to reduce the number of beach tourists.
Tourism is an important pillar industry in Spain.
Spain: It's safe.
In response to Britain's decision, Spain's foreign ministry said on Sunday that the country's outbreak was under control.
Spanish Foreign Minister Arancha Gonzalez Laya told the media: "Spain is safe, not only for Spaniards, but also for tourists."
The Spanish government will try to persuade the British government to exclude the Balearic Islands and Canary Islands from quarantine measures.
The reason is that the infection rate of these two tourist resorts is much lower than that in the United Kingdom.
In order to prevent the spread of the epidemic, Spain's Catalan region has also restarted the "foot ban".
Tourism is an important pillar industry in Spain, which is one of the most popular holiday destinations for British tourists.
Britain’s decision is expected to affect Spain’s tourism industry.
Quiet / Ren Chen (German News Agency, Reuters)
On the first day of Zhongfu: Beijing takes a break from the high temperature and heat to open the rainfall mode-Xinhua.com
BEIJING, July 26 (Xinhua) -- July 26 is the first day of this year's "Zhongfu".
In the early morning of the 26th, the convective weather dissipated the high temperature and swelling in the Beijing area for several days, and a new round of rain will continue for several days.
The Beijing Municipal Meteorological Observatory released at 11 o'clock on the 26th that there were scattered showers in Beijing on the 26th (accompanied by weak lightning), and the maximum daily temperature was only 27 °C; there was small to medium rain at night (accompanied by weak lightning), and the minimum temperature at night was 23 °C.
From the previous 24th to 25th, the whole city of Beijing was in a high temperature blue warning, and the maximum daily temperature in most areas was about 37 °C, and the high temperature of more than 40 ° C was localized.
Fu Tian is the highest temperature in the year, humid, sweltering days, a year there are "three volts", the hottest in the middle, the Chinese people said "bitter summer" at this time.
When entering, the family fills the barn, and the people have the saying of "one-volt dumplings and two-volt noodles".
According to the current forecast, in the next three days, the rainy weather in Beijing.
The meteorological department advises the public to minimize tourism in mountainous areas and guard against geological disasters.
It is understood that this year's "middle volt" has 20 days, starting from July 26 and ending on August 14.
After entering the "middle volt", people will feel physically weak and loss of appetite.
The diet can choose green beans, mushrooms and other foods that have the effect of rejuvenating, spleen and appetizing, as well as bitter foods such as bitter vegetables and bitter melons, which can help improve appetite and relieve heat.
The FAA urgently ordered to check 2,000 Boeing airliners - Xinhua
The U.S. Federal Aviation Administration (FAA) issued an emergency airworthiness directive on the 24th, requiring an emergency inspection of about 2,000 Boeing 737NG and 737 Classic aircraft registered in the United States, due to the corrosion of the air check valve of the above-mentioned passenger aircraft, which may lead to engine air parking.
According to the Federal Aviation Administration, it has received so far four reports of aerial parking for 737 NG and 737 Classic, resulting in emergency inspection requirements for passenger aircraft that have been parked continuously for more than seven days or more and those that have flown less than 11 times since returning to flight.
The Federal Aviation Administration warned that if all two engines of the passenger plane's Class 5 check valve are corroded, they may be stuck in the open position, resulting in a complete loss of power and unable to restart the engine.
This aviation regulator has ordered that once it is found that the valve has been corroded, it must replace this key component before the aircraft is put into service again.
Boeing responded later in the day that the outbreak of the new crown epidemic led to a decrease in travel demand, and many passenger aircraft were sealed or used less, and "the check valve is more likely to be corroded."
At the same time, Boeing said that it has been recommended that air operators check the passenger aircraft involved in the instructions, and if a problem is found, Boeing will provide assistance such as overhauling and replacing check valves.
According to the Associated Press, major U.S. airlines usually fly multiple times a day, but after the outbreak of the new crown epidemic, a large number of passengers were grounded; as the demand for passenger travel has recently increased slowly, some passenger aircraft have returned to operation.
The FAA did not release the details of four aerial parking reports.
Alaska Airlines disclosed one of the incidents later on the 24th.
The carrier said in a statement that on the way from Seattle, Washington to Austin, Texas, on July 15, an engine suddenly turned off, and the passenger plane finally made a successful emergency landing at Austin Airport.
Alaska Airlines said it had replaced the plane's engine and had inspected the engines of six aircraft in accordance with FAA instructions.
U.S. Airlines, United Airlines and Southwest Airlines separately said on the 24th that there was no engine shutdown of associated air check valves.
Four U.S. airliners will be inspected, and United Airlines' 28 airliners will be inspected.
Delta Air Lines said it would inspect 20 of its airliners, but did not say whether there had beeen engine shutdowns.
According to multiple media reports, the Federal Aviation Administration's emergency airworthiness directive is another impact on Boeing.
One Boeing 737 MAX passenger aircraft from Lion Air Indonesia and Ethiopian Airlines crashed in October 2018 and March 2019, respectively, resulting in 346 deaths.
This series of passenger aircraft was subsequently grounded around the world, discontinued in January this year, and resumed production in May.
Federal Aviation Administrator Steve Dixon admitted in June that the Federal Aviation Administration had made “a mistake” with regard to the regulation of Boeing for the 737 MAX.
"Ding dong on the line! teachers good" next week on-line Xue Zhaofeng led the "knowledge promoter-Xinhua.com
There is also a new show on the line.
The interactive knowledge-sharing show "Ding Dong Online!" will be broadcast on Hunan Satellite TV from July 20.
It is understood that the program will create a new all-age youth classroom, and a group of talented and talented teachers will be in action to challenge the output of interesting knowledge.
Different from the serious impression of the teacher group in the hearts of the public in the past, the "Ding Ding Online! Teacher Good" gathers a group of knowledge representatives with both face value and talent.
They are both an example of young people's knowledge from a variety of disciplines, but also a group of all-powerful "hands" who will shake the burden and are good at edutainment.
In the program, this group of outstanding young people's knowledge role models, as "knowledge sharing officers", will challenge interesting knowledge classrooms.
They need to impress the spectators who are present through the intellectual output of the attitude, showing the most interesting aspect of their discipline.
And all-age audience composed of the "way to ask the group" scene will put forward a hundred changes, to the "knowledge sharing officer" teaching more difficult, but also to the program to add a little exciting atmosphere.
It is revealed that the "knowledge sharing officer" includes Li Yongle, a physics teacher at the secondary school affiliated with Renmin University of China, Zhang Xuefeng, a famous research instructor, and Wang Lei, a historical teacher with ten years of experience, who will show the "hard core" knowledge of various disciplines to the audience in an unexpected way.
In addition, the program also invited Xue Zhaofeng, an economics professor, as the program's "knowledge promoter", together with Du Haitao and Jin Mengjia, a "dinging assistant teacher", to talk to the audience about youth and create a "people's youth open class".
Chief Secretary of the Government of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region: The situation is grim, all-out anti-epidemic-Zhongxin.com
HONG KONG, July 26 (Xinhua) -- Hong Kong Special Administrative Region Government Secretary Zhang Jianzong said on the 26th that Hong Kong's new crown pneumonia epidemic situation continues to be severe, and if the epidemic turns bad, the SAR government will decisively take more stringent control measures to further restrict the operation of business places and reduce the space for citizens to go out.
However, at this stage, the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region Government has no intention to introduce a "home order" or a "foot ban" to restrict citizens from going out.
On the same day, Zhang Jianzong released a website entitled "The situation is grim, all-out anti-epidemic".
He said that this wave of the epidemic is the most severe in six months, and the next two weeks will be very critical, and every effort should be made to prevent the further spread of the virus in the community.
In addition to taking the necessary measures by the HKSAR Government, it is also very important for the self-discipline and cooperation of citizens.
He called on the public to stay at home as much as possible, reduce social contact and eat out.
The public should cooperate with the compulsory measures of wearing masks to protect themselves and others, and pay attention to personal and environmental sanitation and frequent hand washing, and should suspend non-necessary gatherings of relatives and friends or meals, and reduce them to the street market.
He said that the central government has always been very concerned about the changes in the epidemic situation in Hong Kong and supported the SAR government's anti-epidemic and anti-epidemic work, and actively responded to the latest request of the Chief Executive to provide assistance in increasing testing capabilities and retrofitting the work of the AsiaWorld-Expo Hall for similar "square cabin hospitals".
Zhang Jianzong said that the free virus testing provided by the SAR government for specific high-risk groups, that is, nursing homes and nursing home employees, restaurant employees, taxi drivers and property management employees, has been fully carried out, involving as many as 400,000 people.
He is very concerned about the cases of infection that have appeared in nursing homes, and the SAR government has arranged specific temporary quarantine centers for residents.
He said that the SAR government is building a quarantine facility near the Bamboo Bay Quarantine Center in Lantau Island, New Territories, and is expected to provide an additional 700 isolation rooms by the end of September.
On the 19th, the Chief Executive also announced that the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region Government will build more than 2,000 isolation rooms at the Takeuchi Bay Quarantine Center, and strive to be completed by the end of this year.
Coupled with the 800 that have already been put into use in the quarantine center, it is expected that a total of 3,500 isolation rooms will be provided by the end of the year.
There are currently four operating quarantine centres in Hong Kong, providing about 2,600 isolation rooms.
In addition, on the 24th, the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region Government reactivated Carp Gate Park Resort in Hong Kong Island as a community isolation facility for treating patients under the age of 50 with independent self-care capabilities.
"Nutrition Agents" in the History of the Party and the History of New China-Zhongxin.com
2020-07-26 17:37:29 Source: People's Forum Network Author:Zhu Yanjing Responsibility Editor: Zhu Yanjing
Recently, General Secretary Xi Jinping stressed during his visit to the Siping Campaign Memorial Hall: "It is necessary to let 1.4 billion people, more than 90 million party members, especially leading cadres at all levels, study the history of the Communist Party of China and the history of New China very well."
