Opening up the history of the party and the history of New China, it is full of the eternal and unchanging mission of the Chinese Communists and the rock-solid belief, which shows that the Communists will always be with the people.
To understand the history of the party, the history of New China's important events, important meetings, important people, is not only an intuitive mental shock, the baptism of ideas, but also from the depths of the soul to understand the connotation of the original faith, to know the weight of the mission.
