Since the founding of the Communist Party of China, it has successively shaped a series of great spirits such as the spirit of the red ship, the spirit of Jinggangshan, the spirit of the long march, the spirit of Yan'an, the spirit of resistance to war, the spirit of Xibaipo, the spirit of "two bombs and one star", and the spirit of aerospace.
The great spirit under these historical precipitations has provided a strong spiritual incentive for our party to overcome various risks and challenges on the way forward, and is a precious spiritual wealth that cannot be defeated, dispersed, or taken away.
The process of studying the history of the Party and the history of China is the process of shaping these spirits, and it is necessary to consciously take the lofty spirit of the revolutionary ancestors as the mirror, adhere to the spiritual home of good Communists, build a solid spiritual base for promoting great undertakings and realizing great dreams, and inherit and promote these spirits, and radiate the light of the new era.
