For party members and cadres, there has never been any history, which can bring more profound warnings, revelations and references than the history of the party and the history of New China.
In the history of the party and the history of New China, we can not only see the great deeds of the older generation of revolutionaries determined to devote themselves to their faith and persevere in their efforts to achieve their stated goals, but also can see that some figures have wavered due to their ideals and beliefs, gone to the profound lessons of the opposite side of the revolution, inspired and warned us that we will never stagnate with a firm determination and will, and always have a strong and tenacious spirit of struggle.
If you want to truly become a firm believer and a faithful practitioner of the lofty ideals of communism, you need to remove the "dust" of thought and strictly prevent the "dirty", and the history of the party and the history of New China should become the basis for every party member and cadre to examine themselves and warn themselves.
Knowledge of history inspiration, in learning the history of the party, the history of New China in the pursuit of the times.
General Secretary Xi Jinping once pointed out: "Learning the history of the party and the history of the country is a compulsory course to adhere to and develop socialism with Chinese characteristics and continue to push forward the causes of the party and the state."
Looking back at history and asking about the original heart, in order to continue the glory and move towards the future.
Every party member and cadre should study the history of the party and the history of New China as a lifelong pursuit, continue to shape the course of their lives in learning, bear the mission of history in their respective jobs, dare to take responsibility, and act actively.
Adhering to the advanced deeds of the older generation of revolutionaries as the reference and guidance, constantly polishing the political nature of the Communists, maintaining the attitude of struggle that only fights for the morning and night, and the spirit of struggle that is more and more difficult to move forward, in the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation, write its own brilliant sum.
"Shangjiang South" in the pursuit of poetic "Yellow River dream"-Zhongxin.com
(China's poverty reduction story) "Shang Jiangnan" in pursuit of poetic "Yellow River Dream"
Yinchuan, July 26 (Yang Di) "Nine songs of the Yellow River thousands of sands, the waves from the ends of the world."
The Yellow River, which arouses the pride of countless literary people, gave birth to the beautiful and rich Ningxia Plain, and now Ningxia, which has the beauty of "Shangjiang South", adheres to the concept of "ecological priority and green development" and pursues the poetic "Yellow River Dream".
"Bibo Dream" of the River Clear Water Show
"The world's Yellow River Fu Ningxia", the Yellow River through Ningxia 397 kilometers, is to raise the side of the "mother river".
However, with the rapid advancement of industrialization and urbanization, there is an imbalance between the development and utilization of rivers and lakes and the protection of management, and chaos such as excessive sewage discharge, basing of lakes, and encroachment on waters are highlighted, resulting in black odor of water bodies, excessive water quality, dirty environment, and ecological degradation.
At present, Ningxia is promoting the restoration of water ecological diversity, and strives to restore the Yellow River.
The water needs to work from the source.
In Yinchuan, Ningxia, the local government adopts the method of "raising standards + pollution control + strict control", all the sewage in the industrial park has achieved centralized treatment, all urban sewage treatment plants have achieved first-class A standard discharge, and the black and odorous water bodies in urban built-up areas have been basically eliminated, and the third batch of China's black and odorous water demonstration cities have been successfully declared.
In addition, Ningxia fully implemented the long-term system of rivers and lakes in 2017, and has now achieved full coverage of the responsibility system of five-level rivers and lakes in districts, cities and counties, and it has become the norm.
The 64-year-old lived in a village along the Yellow River, and he witnessed the change of the Yellow River: “The previous water smelled, and after remediation, there was no odor.”
Gu Jincheng said that the ecological environment is good, his life is more comfortable, and now he and his family often go to the Yellow River for a walk and feel the blue sky.
The "Wetland Dream"
Flying birds, green trees, stairways, turquoise water... The beautiful scenery of "sand gulls flying" has become a reality in Yinchuan's Yellow River Wetland Park in Ningxia.
Through Ningxia, the Yellow River has formed a variety of wetlands such as river wetlands, lake wetlands, swamp wetlands, etc., which plays an important role in promoting the rational use of water resources and water ecological balance, and has also become an important international bird migration channel.
Since 2009, Ningxia relevant departments have invested about 3.45 billion yuan in wetland protection project funds, at present, Yinchuan wetland area of 19,200 hectares, wetland protection rate of 78.5%, there are natural lakes, marsh wetland nearly 200, with 5 national wetland parks, 1 national urban wetland park, 6 autonomous region-level wetland parks, 8 municipal parks.
Lu Jinhu, deputy director of Yinchuan Wetland Conservation Center, told reporters that wetland protection has increased biodiversity, which is particularly evident in birds, and "the gull is an endangered bird, only more than 20,000 in the world, of which Yinchuan Wetland is inhabited by more than 2,000."
At the same time, Ningxia delineated a red line of the 500-meter wetland protection area on both sides of the Yinchuan section of the Yellow River in accordance with the law, and stipulated that any unit or individual may not carry out development, construction and business activities within the scope of protection except for public welfare projects.
Zhao Shaoyong, deputy director of Yinchuan Water Conservancy Service Center, introduced that through pollution source management, comprehensive remediation of the ecology of rivers and lakes and the construction of end wetlands, Ningxia's 9 main water quality has reached the Class IV standard, "now the water is also clear, the fish are also swimming, and the flowers are also opened."
"Drinking water dream" of people's livelihood
Ningxia Yinchuan once had an "embarrassment" title: the only city along the yellow city "keeping the Yellow River lack of water to drink".
Since 2010, Yinchuan City has begun to face the problem of water shortage at the peak of continuous summer, and nearly a decade of "water shortage pain" has become a summer painful experience for many high-floor residents, but under the fact that major water sources are at the limit of over-harvesting, urban underground has formed a large-scale groundwater over-enrichment area, and water-based water scarcity has become a problem for Yinchuan City.
Thanks to the improvement of the water quality of the Yellow River, the water of the Yellow River after drinking and purification has become a good way to solve the drinking water problems of local residents.
Ding Ming, deputy director of Yinchuan Municipal Water Bureau, introduced that in order to improve the demand for water for urban and rural residents in Yinchuan, Ningxia launched the Yinchuan metropolitan area's western water supply project in a timely manner, and replaced the original groundwater source with high-quality Yellow River water.
"On December 29, 2019, the water supply project officially connected to the three districts of Yinchuan City, and in 2020, the residents of Minning Town and Helan County also drank the water of the Yellow River."
Ding Ming said that Yinchuan water conservancy department will consider the transformation of regional rural drinking water and urban water supply integration, "in the next step, we will integrate rural scattered water supply points into the western water supply project, is expected by the end of this year to basically realize Yinchuan area urban and rural integrated water supply."
Complementary Responsibilities All departments to strengthen flood control and disaster relief work-Zhongxin.com
Compression of Responsibilities All departments to strengthen flood control and disaster relief work
CCTV News (News Network): From the Ministry of Water Conservancy news, today (July 25) at 12 o'clock, Huaihe dry Wangjiaba below the section of the ultra-alert water level of 0.64 ~ 3.31 meters, the middle and lower reaches of the Yangtze Yangtze Yangtze River dry sand city below the section of the river and two lakes super-alert water level 0.05 ~ 2.02 meters.
