For the first time, the United States launched a countervailing investigation against China with an “undervalued RMB exchange rate”.
In response to the recent announcement by the U.S. Department of Commerce, it has decided to launch an anti-dumping countervailing investigation on products originating in China, and launch an investigation on the “RMB exchange rate undervaluation” project.
China's Ministry of Commerce pointed out that this is the first time that the United States has investigated the so-called "yuan exchange rate undervaluation" project in a countervailing case, and China firmly opposes it.
China's Ministry of Commerce issued a special press release on the evening of the 23rd, saying that China's implementation of a market-based supply and demand, referring to a basket of currencies for adjustment, managed floating exchange rate system, the market plays a decisive role in the formation of exchange rates.
The press release stressed that in general, the RMB exchange rate is at a reasonable equilibrium level and has not been underestimated.
Since 2005, the RMB has appreciated by more than 17% against the US dollar.
According to the data released by the Bank for International Settlements, from the beginning of 2005 to May 2020, the effective exchange rate of the renminbi appreciated by 38%, and the real effective exchange rate appreciated by 49%, which is the most powerful currency in the G20 economy and one of the most appreciated currencies in the world.
The Ministry of Commerce pointed out that the exchange rate issue exceeded the authority of members to conduct countervailing investigations in accordance with the rules of the World Trade Organization.
In February this year, the United States amended regulations to carry out countervailing investigations on the exchange rates of other countries, which has been suspected of violating WTO rules and has been opposed in many ways.
According to the press release, even according to U.S. regulations, there are a large number of errors in the applicant's appeal content, and there are no necessary elements for countervailing subsidies such as financial support, benefit awarding, and specificity.
China urges the United States to abide by existing international rules and stop countervailing investigations on the so-called “undervaluation of the renminbi’s exchange rate.”
Affected by the further escalation of Sino-US tensions, the exchange rate of the offshore and onshore yuan against the US dollar fell sharply in the 22-day session, and both fell below the 7.0 yuan mark of the US dollar.
Whether the Commerce Department's move is intended to push up the yuan is worthy of attention.
The yuan's spot exchange rate against the U.S. dollar crossed the 7.0 mark on the 23rd and closed at 6.9961.
By the official regulation of the middle price of the RMB against the U.S. dollar exchange rate, on the 24th, 17 basic points were lowered to 6.9938.
With the gradual improvement of the epidemic, the film and television industry, which has been silent for nearly half a year, has gradually returned to normal.
A few days ago, the organizing committee of the 26th Shanghai TV Festival announced the shortlist of this white magnolia award.
In terms of the best male and female actors, the strength of the generation of actors occupy an absolute advantage, Lei Jiayin, Chen Baoguo, Zhang Ruoyin, Sun Honglei, Huang Lei will compete for the best actor, Haiqing, Mai Ling, Qin Hailu, Sun Jun, Yan Ni will compete for the best actresses.
The results will be officially announced on August 7.
Judging from the current point of view, from the topic of college entrance examination, describing the "Chinese-style family" reality education TV series "Little Joy", won the "best Chinese TV series", "best director", "best writer", "best actress", "best actress", "best male and female supporting actor" a total of 6 nominations.
"The best male and female protagonists" award has always been one of the focus of the outside world, this year's competition is also particularly fierce, shortlisted male and female actors are the strength of the good drama, Chen Baoguo, Huang Lei, Lei Jiayin, Sun Honglei, Zhang Ruoxi will be the "best actor" competition.
Chen Baoguo, Huang Lei, Sun Honglei are highly qualified actors in the middle age, 37-year-old Lei Jiayin is also a strength actor, as for 32-year-old Zhang Ruoyun is the youngest finalist.
In 2016, 34-year-old Hu Ge won the Best Actor of the White Magnolia Award for "Lang Luo List", becoming the youngest emperor in the award, and if Zhang Ruoyang can beat several other predecessors this year, he will refresh this record.
The competition for the best actresses is also finally fixed in Haiqing, Mailu, Qin Hailu, Sun Jun and Yan Ni, among the mainstays in the film and television industry, none of the flow flowers are shortlisted.
It is worth mentioning that Sun Jun is shortlisted with the "home" room, this is her sixth time to win the nomination of the award, in 2014 and 2016 she has won the "best actress" two times by virtue of "Spicy Mom" and "Chen Yue Legend".
The Fujian Provincial Health and Health Commission reported the latest new crown pneumonia epidemic on the morning of the 26th, saying that from 0 to 2 p.m. on July 25, Fujian Province reported 1 new imported asymptomatic infected persons outside the province, 1 new confirmed case imported from abroad, and 4 cases of asymptomatic infection imported from abroad.
Among them, the new asymptomatic infected persons outside the province are imported from Dalian, Liaoning Province (Fuzhou city report), and the newly imported confirmed cases are imported from the Philippines (Xiamen city report); 4 new cases of asymptomatic infected persons imported from abroad, including: 1 case imported from the United States (Fuzhou City report), and 3 cases imported from the Philippines (Xiamen city report).
As of 24:00 on July 25, Fujian Province has reported a total of 69 confirmed cases imported from abroad, 66 cases have been cured and discharged from the hospital, 3 cases are currently hospitalized, and there are no deaths; there are 0 suspected cases imported from abroad; 13 cases of imported asymptomatic infected persons imported from abroad are still under centralized isolation medical observation; 296 locally confirmed cases have been reported (295 cases have been cured and discharged from the hospital, 0 cases have been hospitalized, and 1 case of death); 0 suspected cases have been reported.
At present, 14,962 close contacts have been relieved of medical observation, and 324 people are undergoing medical observation.
Nearly 2.4 million confirmed cases in Brazil, the city of Rio announced the cancellation of New Year's celebrations
According to the data, as of now, the cumulative number of confirmed cases and deaths in Brazil ranks second in the world, after the United States.
According to São Paulo, the state with the worst outbreak, there are nearly 480,000 confirmed cases and more than 20,000 deaths.
More than 160,000 cases and 150,000 cases have been confirmed in the states of Ceará and Rio de Janeiro respectively, and more than 140,000 cases have been confirmed in the states of Pará and Bahia.
More than 110,000 cases have also been confirmed in Maranhão and Minas Genas states.
The mayor of Rio de Janeiro, Marcelo Clivera, announced on the 25th that in view of the continuous spread of the new crown pneumonia epidemic in Brazil and the fact that the effective vaccine has not yet been marketed, the city decided to cancel the 2021 New Year celebrations.
In the past, the city held celebrations at the famous Copacabana beach on the occasion of the New Year’s Eve, and the New Year’s Eve on the last day of 2019 attracted 2.9 million participants.
At the same time, the city also decided to postpone the 2021 carnival from February to September next year.
The mayor of São Paulo, Bruno Kovas, has announced on the 24th that it will cancel the city's annual celebration scheduled to take place on Paulista Avenue on December 31 this year, and will postpone the 2021 carnival until the end of May or early July next year.
Venezuela's foreign minister accuses U.S. of fabricating lies of unwarranted attacks on China - Xinhua
Areyasa said that the U.S. government's recent political, diplomatic, economic and public opinion pressure on China is a baseless attack on a sovereign country.
Areasa retweeted a tweet posted on his personal account earlier in the day by Chinese Ambassador to Venezuela Li Baorong and made the above comments.
Li Baorong said in a tweet that China strongly condemns the forced entry of the United States into the Chinese Consulate General in Houston, which constitutes a serious violation of the Vienna Convention on Consular Relations and the China-U.S. Consular Treaty, in which China will make legitimate and necessary reactions.
Venezuelan Vice President Rodrigues, Vice Minister of Foreign Affairs for North American Affairs Carlos Long and other government officials, social celebrities and mainstream media reporters have also retweeted Li Baorong's tweets, condemning the United States' actions as a serious violation of international law.
On the 26th, Philippine President Rodrigo Duterte delivered his 5th State of the Union (SONA), the day before, the cumulative number of confirmed cases of new crown pneumonia in the Philippines exceeded 80,000, of which the number of confirmed cases of the Presidential Department of Public Information (PCOO) and its direct agencies increased to 25 cases.
To this end, PCOO has specially prepared a working group that has not been in contact with confirmed employees to cooperate with President Duterte's press release on SONA.
PCOO Minister Martin Andanar said in an interview with DZBB radio on the 26th that two sets of plans have been prepared for President Duterte's SONA method.
According to Plan A, Duterte will announce SONA at the Batasang Pambansa building of the Philippine Congress in Quezon on the afternoon of the 27th.
Because of the epidemic, only 50 seats were arranged for some cabinet members and legislators of the government, and a video conference room was set up for other cabinet members and local government officials to watch.
All participants passed rapid testing on the same day to gain access to the National Assembly building.
As soon as one of the participants tested positive, Plan B was launched, that is, President Rodrigo Duterte issued the SONA at the Presidential Palace in Malakan, and fewer listening seats were arranged at the scene.
In accordance with the convention, SONA will broadcast live to the Philippines in real time.
As of press time, the Philippine presidential palace has not confirmed whether Duterte's family will attend SONA.
Andanar said that President Rodrigo Duterte's SONA will focus on how the government will lead the Philippines to deal with the new crown pneumonia epidemic and restore socio-economic life; he will also refer to his commitment when he took office, namely anti-government corruption, combating illegal drugs, and reducing poverty.
Duterte will also talk about the administration’s other plans, including creating more jobs, revitalizing the economy, promoting education, and helping overseas Filipino laborers suffering from the epidemic.
Yinchuan: Classification of policies to support the stability of kindergarten teachers - Xinhua
Xinhua News Agency Yinchuan, July 26 (Reporter Ai Fumei) Affected by the epidemic, Ningxia Yinchuan Kindergarten has not yet been restored, especially the pressure on private kindergarten funds has increased, which will have a certain impact on the stability and future sustainable development of kindergarten teachers.
In response to this, Yinchuan City has taken a number of measures such as provisioning subsidy funds for inclusive private kindergartens, stabilizing subsidies for non-inclusive private kindergartens, and reducing rents for private kindergartens to support these kindergartens.
According to the relevant policies of Yinchuan City, for during the epidemic period, the organizers of inclusive private kindergartens (including kindergartens that have been transformed into inclusive kindergartens after the management of supporting kindergartens in urban communities) refer to the minimum wage standards of the three districts, and the basic living expenses of not less than 1,660 yuan will be issued per person per month, and the municipal finance will allocate 6 months of subsidy funds in accordance with the standard of 1,000 yuan per year for inclusive private kindergartens.
For non-inclusive private kindergartens, which also distribute less than 1,660 yuan of basic living expenses per person per month, Yinchuan City will arrange six-month subsidy funds as a stable subsidy fund for early childhood teachers in accordance with the standard of 500 yuan per student per year.
At the same time, for private kindergartens renting state-owned assets, Yinchuan City will reduce the rent of houses for 3 months during the epidemic prevention and control period, and encourage developers and other rental entities to assume social responsibilities, reduce kindergarten rents, and reduce more than 3 months, according to the relevant taxes and fees.
Yangtze River Flood No. 3 in 2020 Forms the Ministry of Water Conservancy to Refinuate and Realize Response Measures-Zhongxin.com
BEIJING, July 26 (Xinhua) -- On July 26 (Reporter Hu Lu) On the 26th, the No. 3 flood of the Yangtze River in 2020 was formed.
On the 26th, the Minister of Water Conservancy called for fine scheduling of the Three Gorges Reservoir, taking into account the upper reaches of the Yangtze River and Dongting Lake, the implementation of wrong peak scheduling, leaving enough storage capacity to prepare for the major floods that may occur, and to ensure the safety of flood prevention in the middle and lower reaches and the important dikes of Dongting Lake.
It is predicted that in the next three days, there will be heavy rain in the eastern part of the southwest, southern Jianghuai, the western part of northern Jiangnan and the eastern part of Hubei and the central part of Guangxi, among which there will be heavy rain in the northern part of Hunan and southwestern Jiangsu; there will be medium to heavy rain in the western part of northern China.
It is expected by the Ministry of Water Resources, affected by the Yangtze River upstream of the Three Gorges Reservoir before and after the 28th storage flow may reach about 60,000 cubic meters per second, and the water levels of the midstream dry-rising lotus lotus pond and Dongting Lake will rise and exceed 0.20 meters; the dry water level of Huai River will generally slow down, and the water level of Hongze Lake will continue to rise slowly.
It is proposed that the Huai River Basin should further increase the intensity of flood excretion, reduce the water level of Hongze Lake as soon as possible, and prepare to face the possible major floods.
It is necessary to do a good job in responding to heavy rains and floods.
He said that the Taihu Basin should continue to increase the intensity of flooding, reduce the water level of Taihu Lake and the surrounding river network as soon as possible, and reduce the risk of high water levels and typhoons in Taihu Lake.
In addition, he stressed that the floods in northern regions such as Inner Mongolia and Hebei have risen and fallen sharply, the warning time is short, and it is easy to cause flash floods and mudslides, and it is difficult to defend; there are many small and medium-sized reservoirs and silted dams, and there are security risks.
58 apps that infringe on the rights and interests of users have been exposed, involving more than ten listed companies-Zhongxin.com
According to laws and regulations such as the Cybersecurity Law, the Telecommunications Regulations, and the provisions on the protection of the personal information of telecommunications and Internet users, third-party testing institutions have recently been organized to inspect mobile phone applications and urge enterprises with problems to carry out rectification.
There are problems with these 58 APPs, including the private collection of personal information, excessive collection of personal information, frequent application permissions, excessive requests for permissions, the difficulty of account cancellation, private sharing to third parties, and the lack of access.
The Ministry of Industry and Information Technology requires that 58 APPs should complete the rectification and implementation work before July 30, and if they are not rectified, the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology will organize the relevant disposal work in accordance with laws and regulations.
Sino-Singapore latitude and longitude reporters combed and found that behind the 58 APPs notified, there were more than ten US stocks, Hong Kong stocks, and A-share listed companies.
For example, "more houses" is a number of products of US listed companies, and there are five major problems of private collection of personal information, excessive collection of personal information, private sharing to third parties, forced users to use the targeted push function, and frequent application permissions.
According to public information, there are more houses than they landed on Nasdaq in November 2019, which is "the first real estate intermediary company in the domestic industrial Internet SaaS (software service) model" to provide online solutions for many intermediary merchants.
In response to the report pointed out that the "where to go network" APP account cancellation is difficult, according to the Beijing News report, where the network responded that in order to prevent the frequent registration of black production and cancel for benefits, where to register on the basis of self-cancellation, cancellation needs to be set for one month.
The comprehensive consideration of cancellation convenience and account security has been changed to write-off effective immediately, and is currently awaiting review.
A network security expert who did not want to be named said to the Sino-Singapore latitude and longitude client that the APP notification of such violations of users' rights and interests has been released three times this year by the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology.
Among them, private collection of personal information, excessive requests for permissions, and the difficulty of the cancellation of accounts are repeatedly "managed".
It can also be found from the notification that the current APP invasion of privacy has attracted more and more attention.
On July 24, on the same day, the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology said that it had issued a notice to promote the special rectification action of APP infringement of user rights and interests in depth.
The special rectification will strengthen supervision and inspection in accordance with regulations, urge relevant enterprises to strengthen the protection of APP personal information, timely rectification to eliminate illegal collection, the use of users' personal information and harassment of users, deceive and mislead users, the implementation of application distribution platform management responsibilities are not in place, and purify the APP application space.
Lewis family: John Lewis is 'fighting for the weakest' fighter
U.S. Congressman John Lewis, a civil rights fighter, was remembered as a “fighter for the weakest fight” at his memorial service on Saturday (July 25).
Lewis' public memorial service has been taking place in Alabama since Saturday.
On the first day, there were two memorial services.
At a ceremonial memorial service Saturday at Troy University in Alabama, Lewis’s five siblings and a nephew talked about him as a loving, abusive, family-heavy man.
Lewis's youngest brother, Henry "Grant" Lewis, said in the meeting: "He's been committed to helping others all his life."
Samuel Lewis said that his mother had warned John "not to get into trouble, don't go into trouble."
He added that John had not heeded his mother’s warning, saying, “We all know that John is always going to get into trouble, he’s always getting into trouble, but it’s because it’s right, it’s good trouble.”
Lewis’s brothers and sisters reminded people at the memorial that John’s most famous argument was to create “good trouble,” that is, as long as for the sake of justice, don’t shy away from provoking trouble.
John had applied to Troy University in Troy City, Alabama, where he was born, but Troy University, an all-white school at the time, had rejected his application for admission.
John Lewis, who preached the gospel against chickens as a child on his farm, eventually earned a degree in religion and philosophy from Fisk University.
Years later, the University of Troy awarded Lewis an honorary doctorate.
U.S. Senator Doug Jones, from Alabama, said current protesters are “protesting peacefully, non-violently,” as Lewis did in the civil rights movement.
Jones said: "Even if President Trump knocked over a boat man and called all the protesters a mob, he was wrong."
The protesters are patriots, and they want the United States to move towards a more egalitarian nation.”
A six-day series of events in honor of Lewis will culminate this week at funerals in Georgia.
Lewis' coffins were parked on Saturday during an open memorial at the University of Troy, where people came to pay homage to the civil rights pioneer.
Later on Saturday, a private ceremony saluted him at a small church in Selma, Alabama, followed by an open memorial service.
On Sunday, Lewis' body will pass through Selma's Edmund Pettus Bridge.
In 1965, he and the demonstrators who demanded the right to vote for blacks were beaten by the Alabama police in front of the bridge, and the police fired tear gas at the demonstrators.
Lewis was nearly killed.
It became known as “Bloody Sunday.”
Lewis' body will be transported to Montgomery, Alabama's capital.
Mayor Steven Reed encouraged people to line up on the pavement and go through the final journey with Lewis.
At the same time, officials asked the public to wear masks and maintain social distance when participating in the event.
Alabama Governor Kay Ivey has ordered the flags to be flown at half-mast on Saturday and Sunday in honor of Lewis.
During nearly a week of commemorative events, Lewis' body will be split in Montgomery's Alabama State Capitol, Atlanta's Georgia State Capitol, as well as the U.S. U.S. Capitol in Washington, D.C., for public mourning.
U.S. House of Representatives Speaker Nancy Pelosi and Senate Majority Leader Mitch McConnell announced last week that people could go to the U.S. Capitol on Monday and Tuesday to pay tribute to Lewis.
Due to the coronavirus outbreak, the public event to mourn Lewis will take place outdoors.
Shenzhen on the introduction of the introduction of health regulations for public comments - Xinhua
Xinhua News Agency, Shenzhen, July 26 (Reporter Mao Sixuan, Bai Yu) encourages residents to diligently do medical examinations and detect problems as soon as possible; prohibit the sale of alcoholic beverages to minors; establish an online game health review system; employers should be equipped with full-time and part-time health management personnel... Recently, the "Shenzhen Special Economic Zone Health Regulations (Draft for Comment)" was officially released, and Shenzhen residents will have their own "health law".
In order to encourage residents to do physical examinations and detect problems as soon as possible, the above-mentioned consultation draft proposes that health departments should formulate basic catalogues of health examination projects according to different ages, occupations and other factors.
The cost of a health examination within the scope of the basic catalogue of the health examination project shall be paid by the social health insurance co-ordinated fund in accordance with the standard of each person once a year.
It is clear that the employer should rationally allocate human resources, arrange the working time of the staff, and implement the rest system for employees with heavy mental and physical labor loads, so as to avoid excessive loss of human function or physical and mental health injuries to the health of employees, and strictly implement the paid leave system for employees.
In addition, the employer should be equipped with full-time and part-time health management personnel, and regularly organize and carry out employee health examinations.
In terms of the physical and mental health of minors, the consultation draft proposes to prohibit the sale of alcoholic beverages to minors, and at the same time restrict the location of the sale of alcoholic beverages, for the violation of the regulations, will be ordered by the market supervision and management department to make corrections, fined 30,000 yuan.
In addition to "prohibition of alcohol", minors should also "multiple sports".
According to the requirements of the consultation draft, the school should arrange student sports activities for more than one hour per day.
For online games, public security, cultural radio and television tourism sports, network supervision, health and other departments should improve the health supervision system of Internet Internet services, establish an online game health review system, and create a good communication space and communication culture for the healthy growth of young people.
In addition, the consultation draft also proposed that flu patients must wear masks in and out of public places, and medical and health institutions will be fined 20,000 yuan for disclosing the privacy of patients without consent.
It is worth noting that in addition to the physical and mental health of the residents, the exposure draft also requires that the various departments in Shenzhen should evaluate the impact of the implementation of public policies on the health of the population before formulating plans and normative documents related to urban spatial planning and construction, industrial park planning and construction, resource development and utilization and ecological environment protection, biomedical industry development, and approval of major construction projects and the implementation of major public service projects.
If it is not assessed or evaluated, it will have a more serious adverse impact on urban public health or the health of residents, it shall not be formulated or approved for implementation.
