In 2020, the work of directly recruited non-commissioned officers will be fully carried out - Xinhua.com
BEIJING, July 26 (Xinhua) -- The Ministry of Political Work of the Military Commission and the Ministry of National Defense Mobilization of the Military Commission recently jointly issued a notice to deploy the direct recruitment of non-commissioned officers from graduates of ordinary colleges and universities in 2020.
This year's non-commissioned non-commissioned officer covers more than 270 general-purpose majors in 64 categories of computers, automation, and machinery, focusing on increasing the recruitment efforts of drones, navigation, aerospace, electronic information, small languages and other professions, and the recruitment scale has increased by nearly 2,000 people compared with last year.
This year's sergeant recruitment work is synchronized with the implementation of compulsory recruitment, starting on August 1 and ending on September 30th.
Recruiting young people through the national conscription network (http://www.gfbzb.gov.cn) to inquire about the conditions of direct recruitment officers and the professional distribution of recruitment, in line with the professional scope and recruitment conditions of the online submission of registration information, according to the unified requirements of the local military service organs, to participate in physical examination, political assessment and other follow-up recruitment work.
Due to the recruitment of qualified young people who have not been recruited as non-commissioned officers due to professional and planning restrictions, they can participate in the collection of compulsory soldiers, and when they are selected as non-commissioned officers at the expiration of compulsory military service, the number of years spent in ordinary higher schools in accordance with the prescribed academic system shall be regarded as the length of service.
This year's non-commissioning work shall be organized by the recruitment office of the people's government at the provincial or prefectural level, and the professional registration potential will be selected on the basis of comprehensively measuring the academic level of the registration object, the performance of professional classes during the school period, and obtaining professional qualification certificates; the scarce profession will be targeted for local institutions that meet professional requirements and have recruitment advantages.
According to the normalized prevention and control requirements of the epidemic, this year's non-communicators do not arrange self-reporting in principle, and will organize transportation and entry into the camp with compulsory soldiers.
From September 1, 2020, the time for directly recruiting non-commissioned non-commissioned officers will be counted, and the time for the troops to issue non-commissioned officers is December 1, 2020.
The receiving unit of the army will scientifically formulate recruitment and professional training programs, and carefully organize the training; after the completion of the training, in accordance with the principles of professional counterpart and consistent recruitment, the recruitment of non-commissioned officers will be uniformly and accurately assigned to the professional and technical positions of counterparts.
Spokesperson of the Chinese Embassy in the United Kingdom: The Chinese government is a staunch defender of network security
