Urumqi free nucleic acid detection in most areas have been basically completed high-risk areas for secondary testing-Zhongxin.com
Urumqi, July 26 (Reporter Sun Tingwen Zhao Yamin) Zhang Wei, director of the Urumqi Municipal Health and Health Commission, said on the 26th that when reporting the latest epidemic situation and nucleic acid detection in Urumqi, most of the free nucleic acid detection work in Urumqi have been basically completed.
Experts from the expert group of the State Council and the autonomous region and Urumqi are making further assessments of the development of the epidemic based on nucleic acid testing and epidemiological survey results.
On the 26th, the press office of the Xinjiang Uygur Autonomous Region held a press conference to report on the epidemic and prevention and control situation in Xinjiang.
According to him, from 0:00 to 24:00 on July 25, there were 22 new confirmed cases of new crown pneumonia in Urumqi (of which 5 were reconfirmed cases of asymptomatic infected persons), and 38 new asymptomatic infected people.
As of 24:00 on July 25, there were 135 confirmed cases and 147 asymptomatic infected people in Urumqi.
On the 25th, the new asymptomatic infected people are basically through the city's free nucleic acid testing and active screening.
Zhang Wei, director of the Urumqi Municipal Health and Health Commission, said on the 26th that most of the free nucleic acid testing work in Urumi City has been basically completed.
He also said that from the experience of other parts of the country, there are many factors that affect the nucleic acid test results, such as the sensitivity of the detection reagents, the infection time and detoxification time of the tested personnel, the cooperation of the tester when the specimen is taken (the poor degree of cooperation may cause the specimen not to be taken in place), the detection environment, and the operational proficiency of the inspection personnel.
Due to a variety of reasons, nucleic acid testing will also have false negative results.
The so-called false negative means that the person being tested is indeed infected, but the nucleic acid test results are negative.
In addition, for people who have been in close contact with confirmed cases and suspected cases, it is usually necessary to have two nucleic acid tests to be excluded.
For people who have been to high-risk areas in the epidemic, if there are fever and respiratory symptoms, there may be false negatives in a nucleic acid test, so two nucleic acid tests are also required to be excluded.
He said that in view of the above situation, for the health of the people of all ethnic groups in the city, starting from today, Urumqi City will carry out secondary free nucleic acid testing in key areas such as Tianshan District and Shaybak District, and at the same time carry out "inspection and make up leaks".
It is reported that Tianshan District and Shaybak District are high-risk areas of the epidemic.
Offline streamlining "cloud" warm Shanghai International Film Festival reveals extraordinary industrial confidence-Zhongxin.com
2020-07-26 06:52:39 Source:Report Author:Wang Sisuo Responsibility Editor:Wang Sisuo
Offline streamlining "on the cloud" enthusiasm, the Shanghai International Film Festival revealed extraordinary industrial confidence
(Chief reporter Wang Yan) yesterday, in the context of strict anti-epidemic measures held in the context of the 2020 Shanghai International Film and Television Festival, with a "comprehensive well-being, dream of a new era" industry summit forum, opened the curtain of the 23rd Shanghai International Film Festival.
As the first international film and television festival held since the continuous spread of the global epidemic and the normalization of China's epidemic prevention and control, this year's Shanghai International Film Festival is of great significance.
On the basis of doing a good job in the normalization of epidemic prevention and control, the holding of the Shanghai International Film and Television Festival is not only a demonstration of confidence, but also a declaration of determination - our confidence in defeating the epidemic remains unchanged, the confidence of running the people's festival remains unchanged, and the confidence determination to build a global film and television creation center and launch the "Shanghai Culture" brand remains unchanged.
Every year, the Shanghai International Film Festival, with continuous innovation and enterprising attitude, is once again and a new beginning.
Therefore, it is necessary to take every step to meet the people's people's spiritual life services and serve the high-quality development of the film and television industry.
Especially this year. 🙂
In order to cherish the hard-won epidemic prevention and control situation, on the one hand, the Shanghai International Film Festival strictly adheres to the requirements of epidemic prevention and control, and implements epidemic prevention and control measures; on the other hand, holding the vision of gathering wisdom for Chinese film creation and meeting the needs of moviegoers, opening a number of online and offline activities.
On the first day of opening, from offline viewing to the industry forum, the relevant activities of the film festival have strictly implemented the relevant epidemic prevention policies.
Forum activities are controlled within 50 people, and each viewing is divided into seats, and the attendance rate is strictly controlled within 30%.
As the organizing committee of the film festival upholds, in any case, "putting the safety of people's lives and physical health first" is a prerequisite.
The offline activities have been greatly streamlined, and there is a lot of excitement on the cloud.
In order to implement the important concept of "people's city construction, people's city for the people", as the people's festival, this year's Shanghai International Film Festival map innovation, for transformation, with online "cloud screening", master class "cloud sharing" and other measures to meet the diverse needs of fans.
On the first day of the opening ceremony, the official partner of the film festival, Mimi video and Oriental Pearl Vision, respectively, gave back to fans of a number of "Belt and Road" films.
That night, the opening forum and Jia Zhanke master class were also online on a number of platforms such as the central video, learning power, and Wenhui App, so that the people can pay attention to the latest trends of Chinese movies without leaving the house.
At yesterday's opening forum, Yan Xiaoming, a member of the party group and deputy director of the Central Radio and Television Station, delivered a speech and announced the opening of the film festival. Zhou Huilin, Standing Committee member of the Shanghai Municipal Party Committee and Propaganda Department, delivered a speech, and Zong Ming, deputy mayor, attended.
White House epidemic expert Fauci: cautiously optimistic about the development of a vaccine in early 2021
Fauci made the remarks at an online video conference sponsored by the International Leadership Foundation on the 25th.
He warned that it is not clear how the new coronavirus outbreak will develop in the autumn and winter, or how the final impact of the epidemic will be, "and the only way to end it is that each of us chooses to become part of the solution."
According to data from Johns Hopkins University in the United States, as of 21:00 on the 25th, the number of new crown confirmed cases in the United States has reached 4.176 million, and 146,000 people have died.
Fauci said that some parts of the United States are currently struggling with the rebound of the epidemic.
Although epidemics vary from place to place and need to respond according to local conditions, diversified anti-epidemic strategies do not mean that there are no strong links between regions.
An outbreak in one region will eventually affect other areas.
“Now is not the time for complacency,” Fauci said, “Our work is not done, we must step up our efforts, and we must remain vigilant about the uncertainty of the future”.
Chinese-American medical experts and the founder of “cocktail therapy” for AIDS pointed out at the meeting that the new crown epidemic in the United States has not yet reached its peak.
“Each of us must do our part to slow the spread of this virus.”
He Dayi called on the public to use their practical actions to buy time for scientists to step up the development of new crown treatment drugs and vaccines.
The International Leadership Foundation is a non-profit organization dedicated to promoting international exchanges between the United States in the United States and the Asia-Pacific region, committed to promoting the status of Asia-Pacific in the United States, and cultivating international young leaders.
On the same day, U.S. Transportation Secretary Zhao Xiaolan, U.S. Congressman Meng Zhaowen and Dong Jiling, founding president of the International Leadership Foundation, spoke at the meeting.
In particular, they paid tribute to Asia-Pacific medical workers and volunteers fighting the epidemic on the front line, and called on the American public to continue to adhere to anti-epidemic guidelines such as "social distancing" to curb the spread of the epidemic.
Dalian: No new locally confirmed cases of new crown pneumonia, 24 new asymptomatic infected people - Xinhua
Xinhua News Agency, Dalian, July 25 (Reporter Cai Yongjun, Cui Shihao) Dalian released news on the 25th that from 15:00 on July 24 to 14:00 on July 25, there were no new local confirmed cases of new crown pneumonia in Dalian, with 24 new asymptomatic infections and no new suspected cases.
At 14:00 from July 22 to 25, the city reported a total of 12 locally confirmed cases of new crown pneumonia, all of which were centrally isolated and treated at Dalian Sixth People's Hospital.
Zhao Lian, deputy director of the Dalian Municipal Health Commission, said that according to the epidemic situation, Dalian organized the medical staff of the city's third-level hospitals into the street community, opened more than 600 sampling points in Dalian Bay, workers' villages, along the light rail and some key areas of Jinpu New District, fully promoted personnel nucleic acid screening work, and dispatched nearly 2,000 medical staff to carry out nucleic acid testing and sampling every day.
As of 14:00 on July 25, the city had sampled more than 210,000 people.
Among the current 12 confirmed cases in Dalian City, 10 are employees of Dalian Kaiyang World Seafood Co., Ltd.; 46 of the 54 cases of asymptomatic infected persons are the employees of the company and the families of their relatives; among all the nucleic acid test positive cases, the proportion of employees of the company and their relatives reached 85%.
After research and judgment, Dalian decided to strengthen strict control over the close contacts and close contacts of all employees of Dalian Kaiyang World Seafood Co., Ltd., and implemented at least 2 nucleic acid tests for centralized isolation medical observation on the 14th.
At the same time, Dalian decided to further expand the scope of centralized isolation medical observers, and all close contacts and close contacts of close contacts of nucleic acid test-positive personnel (including cases and asymptomatic infected persons) will be implemented on the 14th centralized isolation medical observation and at least 2 nucleic acid tests will be implemented.
Dalian Airport and Dalian Railway Station issued a notice on the 25th, the city's personnel in principle to implement non-necessary non-distancing, really need to be separated, must hold a 7-day kernel acid test negative certificate; Dalian Bus Passenger Terminal from 12 o'clock on the 25th to suspend the city's all line ticket sales, the specific recovery time will be notified separately.
Brazilian study shows that hydroxychloroquine is ineffective in the treatment of new crown pneumonia
Recently, a Brazilian study showed that hydroxychloroquine is ineffective for patients with new crown pneumonia.
The study was published in the New England Journal of Medicine.
The Pakistani researchers divided 667 patients from 55 hospitals across the country into three groups and conducted clinical trials; mainly compared the therapeutic effect of using hydroxychloroquine alone or in combination with other antibiotics azithromycin, and analyzed whether it helped to improve the condition of mild and moderate patients with new crown pneumonia.
The results showed that hydroxychloroquine not only did not have a therapeutic effect, but may have damaging side effects on the organs.
The study was carried out in collaboration with the Brazilian Clinical Research Institute (BCRI) and the Brazilian Critical Care Research Network (BRICNet) in several leading hospitals such as Hospital Israelita Albert Einstein, HCor, Hospital Sírio-Libanês in Syria.
On the 25th local time, Brazilian President Bolsonaro announced through social platforms that the fourth nucleic acid test result was negative.
During the infection, Bolsonaro has been taking hydroxychloroquine and has been actively promoted many times.
Journalist Zhao Yijun
Four departments to carry out a new round of App governance to protect personal information security - Xinhua
BEIJING, July 25 (Reporters Yu Junjie and Chen Aiping) The reporter learned from the National Network Information Office on the 25th that the 2020 App illegal collection and use of personal information management was officially launched in recent days, focusing on cracking down on the strong problems reflected by the masses such as privately uploading personal information in the App background.
It is reported that this round of App governance is carried out jointly by the four departments of the National Network Information Office, the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology, the Ministry of Public Security, and the State Administration of Market Supervision.
According to reports, the special governance working group composed of four departments received more than 12,000 pieces of effective reporting information from netizens last year, carried out verifications for more than 2,300 apps, and adopted public exposures, interviews, and punishment measures such as large-scale and prominent 260 apps for users.
According to the relevant person in charge of the National Network Information Office, the current number of apps has exceeded 5 million, and the problem of collecting and using personal information in violation of laws and regulations has not yet been fundamentally solved.
In 2020, the governance work will be further strengthened to further expand the scope of governance to the SDK (software development kit) and small programs on the basis of app verification.
It is reported that the working group will conduct thematic research and in-depth testing on issues such as irregular collection and use of personal biometric information and the abuse of sensitive permissions of apps, focusing on recording, taking photos and other background authority abuses.
According to the seriousness of the circumstances and consequences of the discovery of the problem, the working group will be interviewed, warned, removed, and fined in accordance with laws and regulations, forming an effective deterrent to illegal activities.
It is understood that the working group plans to formulate and introduce the application store review and management guidelines for the collection and use of personal information by the app store, guiding and urging the application store to do a good job in the pre-line review of the App, and close the strict entrance.
In addition, the working group will also issue free technical tools to guide small and medium-sized enterprises to carry out self-assessment and improve the legal compliance of personal information collection and use activities of small and medium-sized enterprises.
Johns Hopkins University: Global cumulative new crown confirmed more than 16 million cases - Xinhua
NEW YORK, July 26 (Xinhua) -- According to statistics on the new crown epidemic released by Johns Hopkins University on the 26th, as of 2:40 U.S. Eastern Time on the 26th (14:40 Beijing time), the cumulative number of new crown confirmed cases in the world reached 16,048,100, and the cumulative number of deaths was 644537.
According to the data, the United States is the country with the worst epidemic in the world, with a total of 4178027 confirmed cases and 146,460 deaths.
The cumulative number of confirmed cases in Brazil is 2394,513 and the cumulative number of deaths is 86,449, both of which are second only to the United States.
In addition, more than 300,000 cases have been confirmed by India, Russia, South Africa, Mexico, Peru, Chile and the United Kingdom.
On the 25th, the 2020 Hunan Red Tourism and Culture Festival and the first Red Culture Industry Expo in Xiangtan kicked off in Shaoshan.
In recent years, the demand for red tourism has gradually increased.
However, the development of the red tourism industry is also facing the plight of fewer young groups, homogenization of tourism projects, and single commercial channels.
In particular, this year's outbreak of the epidemic, the country's cultural tourism industry has suffered serious setbacks, and red tourist attractions are also facing serious challenges.
For example, the use of drone shooting, VR immersive experience and other scientific and technological means, you can meet the tour needs of tourists "people have not arrived, the scenery has arrived"; the introduction of online live broadcasting means, the introduction of red scenic spots, can directly enhance the economic benefits of red tourism; the introduction of "cloud" technology, to create a prominent theme, clear guidance, rich connotation of the boutique display, fully demonstrate and enhance the promotion function of the red scenic spots; innovative red culture, so that the revolutionary cultural relics "live up".
The cultural festival uses the popular "county and city (district) long + professional anchor special promotion" way to promote red cultural tourism products, the use of 5G technology to provide real-time viewing and smart city demonstrations and other services to promote red cultural tourism attractions, are for the red tourism to insert smart wings to try, looking forward to Hunan red tourism more and more popular.
U.S.-China trade negotiator to meet in August
Hong Kong's "South China Morning Post" quoted an anonymous person familiar with the report on the 25th that the head of China's trade negotiation team, Vice Premier of the State Council Liu He and the U.S. team's co-leader and trade representative Lai Haizhe are expected to hold formal talks in August to assess the implementation of the first phase of the China-US trade agreement between the two sides.
The report said that although China has significantly increased its purchases of US agricultural products in the past few months, due to factors such as the new coronavirus epidemic, China's procurement volume is still somewhat away from the amount promised in the trade agreement.
Analysts say that the recent U.S.-China closure of each other's consulates, coupled with other disputes, may undermine any progress on trade between the two sides.
The first phase of the trade agreement between China and the United States, which came into effect one month after it was signed on January 15, stipulates that a high-level trade framework group between the two sides should hold talks every six months.
According to people familiar with the matter, the meeting will be “an important turning point” for the two sides to assess the progress of the agreement.
However, the person also said that if the U.S.-China tensions lead to a low willingness to talk at this time, the two sides may agree that Lai Haizhe and Liu He's May 8 teleconference, that is, have met the terms of the semi-annual talks in the trade agreement.
Since the beginning of this year, China-US relations have deteriorated rapidly, and disputes between the two sides have included a series of issues such as the origin of the new coronavirus, trade, Hong Kong, Xinjiang, the South China Sea and ideology.
Although U.S. President Donald Trump boasted at the beginning of the year about his achievements in the first phase of the agreement, his attitude has changed recently.
He said at the White House press conference on the 23rd that although China has recently purchased a record number of U.S. corn in a single day, it has also bought a lot of soybeans, "but this trade agreement is no more important to me than when it was reached."
An anonymous Beijing government adviser also believes that a new round of trade negotiations is unlikely to take place due to poor U.S.-China relations, and "trade issues have lost weight in China-US relations."
However, he revealed that China's economic and trade-related units still met on the 23rd to discuss a series of issues, including how to increase imports from the United States, "we have done our best to buy, so any additional procurement will be difficult."
Peng Jening, vice president of the U.S.-China Business Council, said it was "more important than ever" to maintain the momentum of the first phase of the agreement, adding that China had made progress this year in opening up financial markets to U.S. companies.
Plenum analysts, an independent research firm, said: "It's better not to talk, although it may only be treated as routine."
BEIJING, July 26 (Xinhua) -- Reporter Wei Yukun learned from the Ministry of Emergency Management on the 26th that the State Defense Office and the Ministry of Emergency Management, together with the State Food and Material Reserve Bureau, once again urgently transferred 1.35 million woven bags, 1.2 million square square meters of woven fabrics, 130,000 square meters of geomoil cloth and other 6 types of central reserve flood control materials to support Anhui flood relief work.
According to the relevant person in charge of the Ministry of Emergency Management, at present, the middle and lower reaches of the Yangtze River and the Huaihe River Basin maintain high water level fluctuations, and the "No. 3 flood of the Yangtze River in 2020" was formed in the upper reaches of the Yangtze River on the 26th, and the risk in local areas increased.
The meteorological department expects that there will be heavy rainfall in Chongqing, Guizhou and the middle and lower reaches of the Yangtze River in the next three days, and the flood control situation is still severe and complicated.
According to reports, since entering the flood, the Ministry of Emergency Management has deployed national comprehensive fire rescue teams to pre-position professional rescue forces in key flood control areas, participating in 10,364 anti-flood rescues of all kinds, dispatched more than 130,000 soldiers, 17,778 fire trucks, 11,887 boats, rescuing 37,777 people in distress, and evacuating more than 107,000 trapped people.
Hao Yusheng, chief representative of Nasdaq in China: It is now the best time node for Chinese companies to go to the United States for IPO - Economic Watch - Professional financial news website
Economic Observer Network reporter Zhang Bin because of Luckin coffee fraud incident, the U.S. market to implement more stringent supervision of the stock, coupled with long-term pressure on the valuation, listed in the United States of the medium-sized stock pressure, NetEase, Jingdong and other medium-sized stocks have recently opened the way back to Hong Kong listing.
In the near future, companies such as shells and ideal cars have gained enthusiasm for listing in the United States.
Under the epidemic and the crisis of Chinese stocks, is now the best time for Chinese enterprises to go public in the United States?
"In terms of the recent IPO cases and the next company to go to the United States to go to the United States, the IPO to the United States is essentially not affected, but now the market is very good, and even now this is the best time point for Chinese companies to go to the United States IPO in the past 10 years."
Hao Yusheng, the chief representative of the China area of the Nasdaq stock exchange, said at the "Listed Company Leaders Summit in 2020" hosted by Snowball.
In April, the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) and the U.S. Public Company Accounting Regulatory Commission (PCAOB) issued a statement on the important role of audit quality and regulatory access to auditing and other international information.
Although international cooperation and coordination have increased significantly in recent years, U.S. regulators still have problems with access to information, and the SEC and PCAOB still face legal and practical challenges; corresponding to this document, the PCAOB website details the list of listed companies that have encountered audit obstacles and their audit institutions.
In addition, in May this year, the U.S. Senate passed the Foreign Company Accountability Act, which imposes additional information disclosure requirements for foreign companies to list in the United States.
In Hao Yusheng's view, the crisis did not affect the appetite of investors.
"When this news first came out, everyone was asking if they could go public in the United States in the future, but then we found that these problems are not good on the investor's side, and investors may ask these questions during the recent roadshow to the U.S. IPO, and even become a standardized problem, but this is not regarded by investors as an important factor in investing and not investing in a Chinese company."
It is recommended that you look at the current situation as carefully as possible.
Of course, the surface looks likely to be the most serious situation in the past two years, but in terms of the appetite of investors, there has been no impact.
Therefore, from now until the end of this year or before the U.S. election, the enthusiasm for IPOs in the United States will continue."
On May 9 this year, Jinshan Cloud was officially listed on Nasdaq in the United States, becoming the first Chinese company to go to the United States for IPO after the epidemic.
"The listing of Jinshanyun is very confident for Chinese companies that are preparing for an IPO."
Hao Yusheng said.
Snowball released in the first half of 2020, the first half of 2020 stock data report shows that in the first half of this year, a total of 20 Chinese IPOs in the United States, an increase of 17.6% over the same period last year; from the point of view of total initial fundraising, 20 companies raised a total of 2.725 billion yuan, compared with the same period last year, up more than 52.4%; in terms of industry distribution, the first half of this yeard of this year, the number of the health care industry IPO is prominent, an increase of 100% over the same period last year.
According to Hao Yusheng, Chinese companies going to the U.S. IPO in the first half of this year are of high quality and high-quality companies with strong fundamentals and growth, which will be more favored by investors.
In the short, medium and long term, Hao Yusheng continues to be optimistic about Chinese companies going to the United States.
"Short-term is to go to the U.S. IPO boom is still continuing; in the medium term is that Chinese companies have more choices, A-shares, Hong Kong stocks, U.S. stocks, we will take the U.S. election and Sino-US relations as a consideration of market choices and time choices; in the long run, everything will return to the norm, the volatility of the market is the cycle, both the political cycle and the economic cycle will eventually return to the normal stage.
Hao said, “There are many uncertainties this year, but for high-quality companies, regardless of whether the market is good or bad, as long as they are solid and have growth that investors can see, other factors are relatively secondary, and investors need to invest in excellent Chinese companies.”
BEIJING, July 26 (Reporter Gao Kai) On the evening of July 25th, the "Dance of Life" of the National Grand Theatre's "Such as Summer Flowers" series of concerts was synchronized online and offline as scheduled, and conductor Yang Yang, pianist Zhang Haochen and the National Grand Theatre Orchestra cooperated on the same stage to play Rachmaninov's "Second Piano Concerto" and "Symbling Dance".
At the same time, located in the sub-center of Beijing's sub-center of the National Grand Theatre Taihu Theatre also ushered in the first offline performance since the anti-epidemic, conductor Zheng Jian and the National Grand Theatre choir passionately singing the "Taihu Sunday Concert" of the army's song-Military choral song concert.
After the downgrade of the epidemic response level in Beijing, in accordance with the city's epidemic prevention and control requirements and the spirit of the city's relevant department documents, the National Grand Theatre, in accordance with the principle of "prudent opening and gradual liberalization", performed the concert on July 25 for the first time.
Jin Hui, Director of the Market Department of the National Grand Theatre, said: "This is the first performance project of the National Grand Theatre to sell tickets to the audience since the epidemic began.
According to the relevant requirements of epidemic prevention and control, the real-name sales and admission of "one person, one vote, one card, one code" are implemented, and the number of sales does not exceed 30% of the entire seat.
Subsequently, performances and artistic activities such as the drama "Look at Chang'an in the West", the special planning concert of the August 1st Military Festival, and opera films will also be limited to the public."
On July 25, the concert also continued to be broadcast simultaneously on the classical music channel of the National Grand Theatre and a number of online platforms, and as of 12 p.m. on the 25th, the online broadcast of the concert exceeded 30 million hits.
The evening concert was opened in the sound of the piano at the beginning of the "La II", and this is the first time that the "sound like summer flowers" series of concerts of the national theater has dedicated the piano concerto to the audience.
Zhang Haochen with his deeply condensed understanding, playing works full of sorrow and entanglement of the first theme, under Yang Yang's conductor, the orchestra and the piano in the ups and downs of the competition and compromise to create a series of hearing enjoyment.
After experiencing the second movement's "such as water quiet" and the "grand carnival" of the third movement, more than 100 spectators broke out with warm applause when they returned to the scene, and the online audience also issued a heartfelt admiration in the form of barrage and comments.
Subsequently, Zhang Haochen gave back to the audience with a song to return to Chopin's "Nocturne in the C minor".
After a short stage adjustment, Yang Yang conducted the orchestra of the National Grand Theatre to play Rachmaninoff's last major orchestra, "Symbling Dance", in which the composer presented a more introspective emotion and integrated into his new inspiration and memories of past creations and homelands.
In Yang Yang's calm and calm treatment, the melancholy temperament of this work and the magnificent atmosphere are revealed, and the orchestra also dazzled Rachmaninoff's "last spark".
Once again, the pre-show guide of this concert brought unexpected surprises to the audience.
CCTV's "News Network" anchor came to the National Grand Theatre's back-stage make-up room to reveal the "stronghold" in front of Jegeyev, Lang Lang and other music masters, and then he came to the public space on the first floor of the National Grand Theatre, in front of the three nine-foot piano with Yang Yang, Zhang Haochen and the National Grand Theatre to carry out the dialogue, just with a senior piano lover's perspective to discuss the maintenance and maintenance of the piano.
On that night, at the National Grand Theatre Taihu Amphitheatry, the military song-military choral song concert kicked off in the melodious "Don't forget the original heart".
This is the first performance since the "Taihu Weekly Concert" anti-epidemic of the National Grand Theatre.
It is reported that on August 1st, Zheng Jian, the conductor, will also continue to bring "Soldiers and the motherland" with the National Grand Theatre Choir - the National Grand Theatre celebrates the choral concert of the Eighth Army Festival, as a series of online performances of "sounds such as summer flowers", synchronously broadcast through the Internet, paying tribute to the soldiers defending the motherland in the classic song.
Heilongjiang half a year to deal with drunk driving 22,000 - Xinhua network
Xinhua News Agency, Harbin, July 26 (Reporter Liang Shubin) The reporter learned from the traffic police headquarters of the Heilongjiang Provincial Public Security Department that in the first half of this year, the public security traffic control departments around Heilongjiang Province investigated and dealt with 22,000 cases of drunk driving.
Recently, when the traffic police in Hegang City were on duty at the service station, a driver saw a traffic police on duty and threw down the car to run.
The on-duty police quickly chased him and arrested the suspect, Wang, in the warehouse of a villager's house.
The on-site test results of the exhaled alcohol tester are 28.4mg/100ml, and Wang drives a motor vehicle after drinking alcohol.
The police imposed an administrative penalty of 2,000 yuan, suspended motor vehicle driver's license for 6 months, and driver's license for completing 12 points at a time.
Since the beginning of this year, the public security traffic control department of Heilongjiang Province has continued to rectify the illegal and criminal behavior of drunk driving, "drinking without driving, driving without drinking" has become a social consensus.
However, there are still drivers who are lucky and wantonly drunk driving, and in the first half of this year, the public security traffic control departments in the first half of this year investigated and dealt with a total of 22,000 cases of drunk driving, of which 3,744 were drunk driving.
Chongqing Wulong landslide formed Yansai Lake local emergency transfer of more than 500 people - Xinhua
Xinhua News Agency, Chongqing, July 26 (Reporter Zhou Wenchong, Ke Gaoyang) The reporter learned from the Wulong District Government of Chongqing on the 26th that heavy rains led to local landslides and the formation of Yansai Lake, and more than 500 people were urgently transferred.
Affected by continuous rainfall, since July 22th, a large-scale landslide deformation has occurred after the cracking of the soil after the landslide in Liujing Village in Wulong District, and the landslide body fell into the Wujiang tributary along the Cang River.
On the 25th, the local heavy rainfall weather process, the landslide further expanded, resulting in the interruption of road traffic in the village road, and completely blocked along the Cang River, the formation of a dam before the water level of 13 meters, the reservoir capacity of about 420,000 cubic meters of the lake.
According to the on-site survey and monitoring, the volume of the landslide is about 1.3 million cubic meters, it is still in an unstable state, there are scattered rocks, and there has been a dam overflowing situation, and there is a risk of embankment, which poses a threat to the downstream power station and the field town.
After the accident, the local government organized the evacuation of residents along the river overnight, and urgently transferred the masses to a safe area.
At present, 162 households and 520 people in the insurance area have all been evacuated, and the disposal of Yansai Lake is still in progress.
Reuters: Alibaba founder Ma Yun was summoned by an Indian court
The report was quoted as saying that an Indian employee who had worked for Alibaba's UC browser sued, saying that he had been fired because of his opposition to censorship on the company's applications and the content of false news.
The former employee also took out some screenshots as evidence, saying it showed that Alibaba's UC News App released fake news about India, especially the headline section.
He also said that an app called the UC Web will review content that contains keywords such as the Sino-Indian border and the Sino-Indian war.
According to court documents, a civil judge in a district court in New Delhi’s satellite city of Gurugram has issued subpoenas to Alibaba, Ma, and more than a dozen individuals or companies asking them to appear in court on July 29 or through their lawyers.
Earlier, on June 29, India's Ministry of Electronic Information and Technology announced a ban on 59 Chinese applications, including UC News, UC browser, TikTok, WeChat and Weibo, citing security concerns.
People's Daily commentator: focus on running their own affairs to create new advantages for future development - On learning and implementing General Secretary Xi Jinping's important speech at the entrepreneur symposium - Xinhua.com
BEIJING, July 25 (Xinhua) -- People's Daily July 26 commentator's article: Concentrate on running your own affairs to create new advantages for future development
At present, the global epidemic and the world economic situation are still severe and complicated, and the challenges facing China's development are unprecedented.
Maintaining strategic focus, enhancing confidence, and focusing on running our own affairs are the key for us to deal with various risks and challenges.
At the entrepreneur symposium held recently, General Secretary Xi Jinping stressed that in the external environment of rising protectionism, sluggish world economy and shrinking global markets, we must focus on running our own affairs, give full play to the advantages of the domestic ultra-large-scale market, and gradually form a new development pattern featuring domestic large-scale circulation and domestic and international dual-cycle mutual promotion, improve the modernization level of the industrial chain supply chain, vigorously promote scientific and technological innovation, accelerate key core technology research, and create new advantages for future development.
Those who are wise, and those who win.
In the external environment of the in-depth development of economic globalization, the market and resources have played an important role in China's rapid development.
At present, the world under the impact of the epidemic is undergoing profound changes, facing more unstable and uncertain factors, and economic globalization has encountered headwinds and back waves.
To prepare and work for a long time to deal with changes in the external environment, to promote China's economy to ride the wind and waves, steady and far, an extremely important aspect is to expand and meet domestic demand as a strategic basis for development, give full play to its own advantages, through the prosperity of the domestic economy, unblock the domestic cycle to add impetus to China's economic development, driving world economic recovery.
We must deeply understand that building a complete domestic demand system is related to China's long-term development and long-term stability.
The Party Central Committee reviewed the situation and clearly proposed to firmly implement the strategy of expanding domestic demand, which is the need to deal with the impact of the epidemic, the need to maintain the long-term sustained and healthy development of China's economy, and also to meet the people's growing needs for a better life.
The advantage of a large country’s economy is an internal cycle.
China has the world's most complete and largest industrial system, strong production capacity and perfect supporting capacity, with more than 100 million market players and more than 170 million people with higher education or all kinds of professional skills, as well as the ultra-large-scale domestic demand market formed by 1.4 billion people, including more than 400 million middle-income groups, is in the stage of new industrialization, informatization, urbanization and rapid development of agricultural modernization.
The common development of public ownership as the main body, the common development of a variety of ownership economies, the distribution of labor as the main body, the coexistence of various distribution methods, the socialist basic economic system such as the socialist market economic system can not only stimulate the vitality of all kinds of market entities, liberate and develop social productive forces, but also promote efficiency and fair organic unity, and continuously realize common prosperity.
We must firmly grasp the strategic base of expanding domestic demand, so that all aspects of production, distribution and circulation can rely more on the domestic market to achieve a virtuous circle, clarify the strategic direction of supply-side structural reform, and promote the dynamic balance of total supply and aggregate demand at a higher level.
It is necessary to accelerate the construction of a complete domestic demand system, vigorously promote scientific and technological innovation and other aspects of innovation, accelerate the promotion of strategic emerging industries such as digital economy, intelligent manufacturing, life and health, and new materials, form more new growth points and growth poles, and gradually form a new development pattern with domestic large-scale circulation as the main body and domestic and international dual-cycle mutual promotion.
Opening up brings progress, and closure will inevitably fall behind.
General Secretary Xi Jinping has repeatedly stressed that China's open door will not be closed, it will only open wider and wider.
Taking domestic large-scale circulation as the main body, it is by closing the door to close the operation, but by realizing the potential of domestic demand, so that the domestic market and the international market can be better connected, and the international and domestic two markets and two resources can be made better to achieve stronger and more sustainable development.
At the same time, expanding domestic demand and expanding opening up are not contradictory, and the smoother the domestic cycle, the more conducive it is to build a new pattern of opening up, and the more conducive it is to form new advantages to participate in international cooperation and competition.
Although the current trend of international protectionism is rising, we must stand on the right side of history, adhere to deepening reform, expand opening up, strengthen opening-up and cooperation in the field of science and technology, promote the construction of an open world economy, and promote the construction of a community with a shared future for mankind.
The Chinese nation has experienced many hardships in its history, but it has never been crushed, but it has become more and more courageous, constantly growing up and rising from suffering.
On the way forward, with the strong leadership of the Party Central Committee with Comrade Xi Jinping as the core, the significant advantages of the socialist system with Chinese characteristics, strong mobilization ability and strong comprehensive strength, and the unity and struggle of the whole Party and the people of all ethnic groups in the country, we will surely be able to overcome all difficulties and obstacles, maintain China's good economic and social development momentum, build a well-off society in an all-round way, and smoothly start a new journey of building a modern socialist country in an all-round way!
The balance of treasure income fell "post-90s" but "retaliatory" saving money?
With the decline of the balance of treasure income, the "post-90s" not only did not escape the balance treasure, but began to "retaliate" to save money.
China New Economic Research Institute and Alipay recently released the "balance treasure after 90 to save money report" (2020 version) shows that in the first half of the year, "post-90s" is more likely to save money: the amount of money saved per capita increased by nearly 40% compared with 2019.
What's interesting is that the "post-90s" are more inclined to start saving from a "small amount of money", and 60% of the average amount of money saved is less than 20 yuan.
Saving money with the balance has also become the “post-90s” habit of saving money.
According to the data, among the 700 million balance treasure users, there are 134 million users who are "post-90s".
There are 174 million "post-90s" in China, that is to say, about 3 out of every four "post-90s" in the country save money.
At present, the 7-day annualized rate of return of monetary funds such as balance treasure has fallen to about 1.5% from above 2% at the beginning of the year.
Even so, it did not affect the pace of “post-90s” saving money.
Under the background of the improvement of the "money saving effect" of the balance treasure, many young people who are accustomed to using balance treasure have also been directly transformed into "customers".
Alipay data show that as of July 13, nearly a month on Alipay's new "customan" increased by more than 1 times year-on-year, and more and more young people achieved "advanced" financial management on Alipay.
Some analysts believe that the flow of funds into the stock market from the balance treasure is also an important reason for the clear decline of the IMF's share in June.
The report also shows that "post-90s" girls are more inclined to save more money, on average 20% higher than that of boys; among the users who hold funds on Alipay platforms, 60% are men, and women tend to choose a more stable way of financial management compared with men.
What are the plans for “post-90s” after saving money?
Alipay data show that the "post-90s" have the habit of saving money for their goals, and the users who use travel as the goal of saving money.
Affected by the epidemic, many "post-90s" saved money to prepare for post-epidemic travel; cinemas resumed business, which also provided a new way from saving money to consumption.
