APEC member trade ministers say will accelerate regional economic recovery - Xinhua
KUALA LUMPUR, July 25 (Xinhua) -- A video conference of trade ministers of members of the Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC) was held on July 25, pledging to work to reduce the impact of the new crown epidemic on the region's economy and accelerate the realization of resilient, sustainable and inclusive regional economic recovery.
The meeting was moderated by this year’s APEC Economic Leaders’ Meeting in Malaysia.
In a joint statement issued after the meeting, APEC member trade ministers recognized the importance of a free, open, fair, non-discriminatory, transparent and predictable trade and investment environment to drive economic recovery at this challenging time.
All parties committed to ensure that the emergency measures taken in response to the outbreak are targeted, appropriate, transparent and temporary, without creating unnecessary trade barriers and disrupting global supply chains, while complying with World Trade Organization rules.
In the statement, APEC member trade ministers pledged to strengthen cooperation to promote the necessary flow of goods and services, promote connectivity by strengthening the resilience of supply chains, and minimize disruptions to the flow of medical supplies, food and agricultural products in response to the epidemic.
APEC member trade ministers agreed on the need to discuss ways to reduce non-tariff barriers that restrict trade in essential goods, and reiterated their commitment to promoting the necessary cross-border movement of people without compromising measures taken to stop the spread of the epidemic.
The meeting also issued a declaration on promoting the circulation of essential commodities.
According to the declaration, the economies will ensure that the trade measures taken in response to the epidemic are in line with WTO regulations, and are committed to taking action to reduce non-tariff trade barriers and trade promotion to promote the necessary flow of goods under the epidemic.
Malaysia's Minister of International Trade and Industry Azmin Ali said that despite the impact of the epidemic, Malaysia is still committed to promoting the success of this year's APEC meeting, and the development of APEC's post-2020 cooperation vision is advancing in an orderly manner.
Malaysia has agreed to hold APEC-related meetings by video, but does not rule out the possibility of arranging entity meetings at the year-end of the APEC leaders’ informal meeting.
The Philippine Presidential Department of Public Information has tested positive for a total of 13 people -Zhongxin.com
(Combating the new crown pneumonia) A total of 13 people tested positive by the Ministry of Information of the Philippine Presidential Office
MANILA, July 26 (Reporter Guan Xiangdong) The Ministry of Information (PCOO) of the Presidential Office of the Philippines issued a notice on the 25th that the Minister Martin Andanar accepted the negative result of the new crown pneumonia test on the 24th.
As of the afternoon of the same day, PCOO had a total of 13 employees tested positive, after three positive people, one dead or two are still receiving treatment.
Due to contact with an infected PCOO employee, on the 24th, Andanar and 49 PCOO employees were tested for new crown pneumonia.
According to the report released on the 25th, 10 of the employees tested positive.
Marvin Gatpayat, PCOO's deputy minister of administrative and legal affairs, said that the ministry, located in the new administrative office building of the presidential palace, was originally scheduled to resume office on the day of President Duterte's 5th State of the Union address on the 27th.
On the same day, Martin Andanal assured the public that PCOO continues to fulfill its responsibilities to the people of the Philippines to ensure that important information is provided to the public in a timely manner, while strengthening contact tracing and testing to avoid the further spread of the new crown pneumonia virus among PCOO staff, and he quickly recovers and prays for those who test positive.
The Ministry of Health of the Philippines announced that there were 2019 new confirmed cases in the country on the same day, with a total of 78,412 cases, of which 50,763 cases were still sick, nearly 90% were mild, 9% were asymptomatic, and less than 1% were severe and critical cases.
France increases military investment in space - Xinhua
French Defense Minister Florence Parley said on the 24th that France will add hundreds of millions of euros to the space defense budget and develop space military forces to prevent other countries from making "unfriendly actions" in outer space.
Pally told Provence on the same day that between 2019 and 2025, France's space military project expenditure budget will be increased from the previously proposed 3.6 billion euros (about 4.2 billion US dollars) to 4.3 billion euros ($5 billion).
According to the French Military Planning Act 2019-2025 approved by the French parliament in 2018, France is expected to update the existing observation and communication satellites in the future, launch three electromagnetic listening satellites, and improve the modernization of space surveillance radars.
In July last year, French President Emmanuel Macron announced the establishment of a space military command and "aviation and space forces" within the French Air Force.
Parly said she would officially announce the formation of the Space Force when she visits a military academy in Saloon, Provence, later.
Parley said the Space Force is part of the Air Force and has 500 personnel by 2025.
She said: "The idea that space used to serve the common good of science is gone, and now space is the venue for countries to compete for global hegemony," she said.
Pali reiterated Macron's previous statement, saying that France has no intention of provoking an arms race.
“We are not engaged in an arms race, but it is my duty to be fully aware of the threats we may face.”
Parley rekindles the surveillance of a military satellite shared by France and Italy in 2017.
She sailed a “peek” on a Russian satellite.
The Russian side denied this claim.
Parley said France “soon” will have small patrol satellites capable of detecting and locking in “black hands behind those unfriendly moves.”
According to the French media, the reason why France is seeking to set up a space force is due to U.S. President Donald Trump's request that the U.S. Department of Defense draft a bill on the establishment of a space force in February last year.
In December last year, Trump signed the National Defense Authorization Act, approving the creation of the sixth-largest U.S. military service, the Space Force.
Some experts are worried that these measures by the United States have accelerated the pace of US space militarization, which may lead to a new space arms race.
Xinhua News Agency, Hohhot, July 26 (Reporter Jia Lijun) The reporter learned at the Yellow River Haibowan Water Conservancy Hub Administration that in the past few days, Haibowan water conservancy hub has actively resolved this year's No. 2 flood, as of the afternoon of the 26th, the amount of water coming from the upstream is the same as the amount of discharge, the monitoring data is normal, and the flood is passing smoothly through the Wuhai section of Mongolia in Huanghai.
In order to cope with this flood process, from 0:00 on July 23 at the Huanghe Haibowan water conservancy hub in Wuhai City, Inner Mongolia Autonomous Region, gradually reduced the water level of the reservoir, and the discharge flow did not exceed 3,000 cubic meters per second, and the water level before the dam was reduced to 1,071 meters.
At the same time, start the use of sand scheduling.
In the past few days, the Yellow River Haibowan Water Conservancy Hub Administration has paid close attention to the development and change of the water situation and the flood season, strengthened the operation of the reservoir and the safety management of the dam, and strengthened the inspection and protection of the left and right shores and important parts of the reservoir, especially the insurance section, to ensure safety.
As of 17:00 on July 26th, the storage flow rate of the Haib Bay water conservancy hub was 2,760 cubic meters per second, the discharge flow rate was 2,760 cubic meters per second, and the water level in front of the dam was 1071.5 meters.
At present, the flood relief dam section, soil stone dam section and tail water slope and other hydraulic buildings are normal, the monitoring data fluctuate within the normal range, and the No. 2 flood of the Yellow River this year is steadily passing through the Wuhai section of Inner Mongolia.
Jiangxi financial emergency 280 million yuan of funds to support post-disaster rescue and reconstruction in various places
On July 24, Hukou County, Jiujiang City, Jiangxi Province, assisted some officers and soldiers of the 71st Group of the Chinese People's Liberation Army who were fighting against floods to use the standby gap to help a professional cooperative of vegetable cultivation in Hukou Prefecture to harvest chili peppers.
Affected by the previous heavy rainfall, hundreds of acres of red chili peppers planted by the cooperative have been severely affected, and the loss will be further expanded if it is not picked in time.
China News Agency reporter Futian
Nanchang, July 26 (Yuan Rujing) Jiangxi Provincial Department of Finance on the 26th news, according to the work deployment and requirements of the flood control and drought relief headquarters in Jiangxi Province, the province's finance urgently issued 280 million yuan of central and provincial disaster relief funds to provide financial protection for flood relief and relief for the affected people.
Since July, the flood season and disaster situation in Jiangxi have escalated.
The flooding disaster has led to direct economic losses of 10.07 billion yuan in agricultural and rural areas in the province, affecting an area of 13.169 million mu.
On July 17 and July 22, Jiangxi Province successively issued central disaster relief funds of 60 million yuan and 200 million yuan.
At the same time, according to the changes in the disaster situation, the provincial disaster relief funds were issued in three consecutive batches from the province's special funds for emergency management to 20.30 million yuan to support post-disaster relief and recovery and reconstruction in various places.
The relevant person in charge of the Jiangxi Provincial Finance Department said on the 26th that before the arrival of the flood season, 173 million yuan of various types of disaster prevention and mitigation funds have been issued to ensure early detection, early disposal and early resolution of risk prevention, and to provide financial support for flood relief work.
At present, the water level of Poyang Lake, China's largest freshwater lake in the western part of the Yangtze River, is at a high level.
At 18:00 on the 24th, Jiangxi Province's anti-flood emergency response was downgraded to level II; the provincial disaster relief emergency response level was adjusted from level II to level III.
Disaster assessment and post-disaster recovery and reconstruction will continue.
Kunming, July 25 (Du Xiaotiao) reporter learned from the Yunnan Provincial Department of Finance on the 25th, recently, Yunnan Province's finance to strengthen financing, first issued the Yunnan Provincial People's Government named 20 "beautiful county" provincial award supplementary funds a total of 2 billion yuan (RMB, the same below), each "beautiful county" won 100 million yuan award financial support.
On February 26, 2019, the Yunnan Provincial People's Government issued "Guiding Opinions on the Construction of "Beautiful Counties"", making it clear that Yunnan will create a number of "beautiful counties" with distinctive characteristics, perfect functions, beautiful ecology and livable and livable industries in the province through three years of efforts.
At present, Yunnan has announced 20 "beautiful counties" such as Tengchong City, Shangri-La City, Ruili City, Weishan Yi Hui Autonomous County, Ximei Wa Autonomous County, Pingbian Miao Autonomous County.
It is reported that this provincial-level subsidy funds focus on the "beautiful county" construction of "clean, livable, characteristic" three goals and requirements, focusing on public and public welfare projects, supporting the acceleration of shortcomings and weaknesses, high-standard and high-quality construction, and effectively promoting "beautiful counties" as people's heart projects and people's livelihood projects.
The Yunnan Provincial Department of Finance will work with the Yunnan Provincial Development and Reform Commission to strengthen the supervision of provincial awards and supplementary funds, guide and urge all localities to take strong and effective measures, accelerate budget implementation, transform funds into "beautiful county" construction results in a timely manner, strengthen performance operation monitoring, and improve the efficiency and effectiveness of the use of funds.
On July 26, local time, the Estonian national radio and television reported that near the Berlin Zoo in Germany, an Estonian-licensed Mercedes-Benz left the lane in the early morning of the 26th, injuring seven people.
A rescue helicopter arrived for rescue.
The driver of the car that drove into the crowd was detained by the police.
German authorities said an investigation had been launched and there was no indication that the incident was politically or religiously motivated.
Shortly thereafter, police reported that the 24-year-old driver had lost control of the vehicle while turning left and that it was possible to speed.
The person has been arrested and criminal proceedings have been initiated.
Alexander Linde, chief operating officer of the Estonian police and border service, said that the German police had been in contact with the Estonian police and border service.
Lind said: “I confirm in the news that there is no reason to suspect that it was terrorism, or was motivated by politics or religion.”
Shaanxi: Cracking the problem of helping after relocating to avoid the masses "running on both sides"-Zhongxin.com
Shaanxi: cracking the problem of helping after relocating to avoid the masses "running on both ends"
CCTV News: In response to the follow-up problems encountered by the migrant relocation masses in integrating into local life, Shaanxi Kanglang County built a "good-neighborly home" according to local actual innovation, guiding the relocated villagers to change to the public, and achieving stability, rapid integration, and wealth.
Langao Prefecture is located in the Qinba Mountains, and nearly one-third of the local population has walked out of the mountains through immigration relocation.
The 39-year-old Chai Yangtze River has moved from Zhongwu Village, Yanmen Town, Lanyao Prefecture, to the Mingzhu Community of Democratic Town.
He took the old-age insurance card to the "good-neighborly house" in the community, and completed this year's old-age insurance in less than two minutes.
At the beginning of this year, Langao County included employment, civil affairs, medical insurance and other businesses through the construction of "good-neighborly homes", and the relocated people could handle business at their doorstep.
In the Pearl community, 305 residents entered the local community factory through the "good-neighborhood home" recruitment information.
At present, more than 31 centralized resettlement sites in Arao County have achieved full coverage of community factories, providing 2,598 jobs.
According to the report, the shared accommodation market began to pick up in March.
According to the "China Shared Accommodation Development Report 2020" (hereinafter referred to as the "report") released by the Sharing Economy Research Center of the National Information Center, affected by the epidemic, in the first five months of 2020, the transaction volume of China's shared accommodation market fell by 72.1% year-on-year.
However, the shared accommodation market has recovered since March, and the market turnover, order volume and number of receptions have gradually recovered.
The "report" shows that the transaction volume of the shared accommodation market has dropped sharply, on the one hand, due to the sharp decline in the demand for travel accommodation under the prevention and control of the epidemic, and the sharp decline in orders, the total number of orders in the first five months fell by 65% year-on-year, and the number of receptions fell by 63% year-on-year; on the other hand, the weak demand also led to a relatively significant decline in night prices.
However, in March, April and May, the market turnover increased by 78%, 199% and 35% respectively; the number of orders increased by 141%, 152%, and 50% respectively; the number of recipients increased by 81%, 112%, and 28% respectively.
The report pointed out that the development of the shared accommodation industry has long been promising, but there are still many uncertainties in the near future.
In this regard, Yu Fengxia, deputy director of the Sharing Economy Research Center of the National Information Center, told the "Workers Daily" reporter that the development of shared accommodation needs stronger policy support, on the one hand, it is necessary to do a good job in the implementation of policies that have been issued in the early stage, further strengthen policy promotion, and pay attention to creating a better business environment; on the other hand, it is also necessary to further increase policy guidance and support from various aspects such as stimulating consumer demand, enriching the supply of tourism accommodation services, innovating services, and strengthening cooperation between government and platform enterprises.
According to Reuters, the world's largest steel manufacturer ArcelorMittal has a new coronavirus outbreak at a factory in the Mexican city of Rocárdenas, and 21 people have died so far.
Solorio, secretary-general of Mexico’s mining and metallurgical workers’ trade union’s local chapter, said the dead included factory employees, contractors and suppliers.
Solorio said 21 people had died at the plant since April, nine of whom were unionists.
As a result of strict hygiene measures taken by the factory, it is possible that workers are infected with the virus outside the plant.
According to the union, the plant has more than 7,000 employees.
As of July 25, the cumulative number of confirmed cases in Mexico has exceeded 385,000 and the number of deaths has exceeded 40,000, and Mexico is the fourth highest number of new crown deaths in the world.
Xiamen, July 26 (Yang Fushan Zhangshuyan 许靖熠) China's well-known vascular surgery center - Naval Medical University Shanghai Changhai Hospital vascular surgery, 25 days here with Xiamen University affiliated Zhongshan Hospital vascular surgery contract, join hands to set up a collaborative center to promote exchanges and cooperation between the two sides in the field of vascular surgery, especially in the field of aortic acute illness.
Zhongshan Hospital said that after the vascular surgery of the two hospitals is officially formed into a collaborative unit, remote consultation will be carried out, a real-time online consultation with Changhai Hospital will develop treatment plans, select talents for training and training, and jointly carry out surgical technical exchanges, teaching rooms, etc. for complex cases; for complex cases, experts from Changhai can be invited to the hospital for surgery according to their needs, so as to ensure that patients can enjoy the top medical resources in China.
The two hospitals will also work together to carry out surgical innovation and scientific research work, aortic disease science and early screening work and so on.
Hosted by the Beijing Health Promotion Association and hosted by Zhongshan Hospital affiliated to Xiamen University, the main artery seminar was held in Xiamen on the same day.
At the meeting, two well-known hospitals in Huxia held the signing ceremony of the vascular surgery cooperation center at the same time, and announced the formation of collaborative units to jointly improve the treatment level of vascular surgery-related diseases in southwestern Fujian.
Vascular surgery of Changhai Hospital in Shanghai is the only vascular surgery research institute in the whole army and the only vascular disease clinical medical center in Shanghai, and it is also the first national key discipline of vascular surgery, taking the lead in establishing a professional committee on cavital vasculature of the Chinese Medical Association, which is the top team with deep accumulation in the industry.
Professor Huang Xiaojin, head of vascular surgery at Zhongshan Hospital affiliated to Xiamen University, was interviewed by the media.
The vascular surgery of Zhongshan Affiliated Hospital is the first vascular surgery set up in an independent discipline in Fujian Province, which has long been committed to the diagnosis and treatment of aortic and peripheral vascular diseases, and was approved for the construction of provincial clinical key specialties in 2018.
In the treatment of aortic diseases, in addition to the treatment of mezzanine aneurysms and aortic aneurysms, there is a wealth of experience in emergency ruptured aortic aneurysms.
"Xiamen University Affiliated Zhongshan Hospital vascular surgery from the history of development, the breadth, difficulty, complexity and other aspects of surgical development, in the region is very outstanding, so this time we set up a collaborative center, in addition to the aortic artery, you can also carry out medical, teaching and scientific research on the diagnosis and treatment of the lower limb artery, carotid artery and other diseases to carry out in-depth cooperation."
Professor Feng Rui, deputy director of vascular surgery at Changhai Hospital in Shanghai.
Zhongshan Hospital affiliated to Xiamen University and Shanghai Changhai Hospital signed a contract in 2018 to set up "Li Zhaoshen famous medical studio" of digestive medicine.
Professor Huang Xiaojin, director of vascular surgery of the hospital, said in an interview with China News Network that the vascular surgery of the hospital has also communicated with Changhai Hospital for a long time, and the two hospitals have officially formed a collaborative unit, so that the cooperation and exchanges between the two sides have reached a new level.
He said that the hospital will regularly invite Shanghai experts to Xiamen to carry out surgical technical exchanges, teaching rooms, difficult case discussions, etc. At the same time, it will further carry out remote consultations, and currently plans to conduct remote consultations once a week; in addition, the department will also select and send personnel for training and exchanges, and strengthen the training and development of discipline talent teams.
At the meeting, the reporter learned that vascular disease is China's largest cause of death, and the aorta, as the main road of various organs of the human body, flows from the heart to the whole body and plays an important role.
The occurrence of aortic disease is often accompanied by a high risk, high mortality rate and the difficulty of treatment, the thickest part of the aortic artery is up to 4 cm in diameter, once the formation of angiomas, rupture, or rupture of the lining of blood vessels to produce mezzanine, will cause heavy hemorrhage, very dangerous.
In recent years, with the change of people's lifestyles and the acceleration of the pace of life, China has become the world's largest country in high blood pressure, and the aortic disease has also increased, and now, with the development of surgical technology and industrial materials, the treatment of aortic diseases continues to develop in the direction of minimally invasive, rapid and efficient.
The doctor can properly "change the lane" of the blood flow by piercing from the thigh and placing it in the aortic artery, so as to avoid the impact on the aneurysm or ruptured mezzanine to achieve a good therapeutic effect, and some operations even only need to perform local anesthesia.
This academic seminar invited more than ten domestic experts to discuss new developments in the treatment of aortic diseases, and carry out cutting-edge technical training and difficult case discussions in the form of conference salons.
At the meeting, the reporter learned that with the development of surgical technology and industrial materials, the current treatment of aortic diseases continues to develop in the direction of minimally invasive, fast and efficient.
The National Defense Department continues to maintain the second-level response of the Yangtze River and Huaihe flood control - Xinhua Network
There will be heavy rainfall from the Sichuan Basin to the middle and lower reaches of the Yangtze River.
The National Defense Department continues to maintain the second-level response of the Yangtze River and Huaihe flood control
The reporter learned from the Ministry of Emergency Management on the 25th: It is expected that until the 27th, there will be heavy rainfall from the Sichuan Basin to the middle and lower reaches of the Yangtze River, and it is necessary to continue to pay attention to the impact on the Yangtze River and the Huaihe flood, and some parts of the Yangtze River and Huai River basin will be soaked for a long time, and there will be high risks such as landslides, landslides and pipe surges.
The National Defense General Administration decided to continue to maintain the II response of the Yangtze River and Huaihe flood control.
On the 25th, the meeting of the Ministry of Water Conservancy stressed that the middle and lower reaches of the Yangtze River maintained a high water level, Huaihe dry flood peak through the Anhui Bengbu River section, the water level of Taihu Lake has continued to exceed the police for 28 days, super guarantee for 9 days, the current flood control situation is still grim, and the flood control work cannot be completely relaxed, and it is necessary to continue to do a good job of defense.
At the same time, we will do a good job in preventing heavy rainfall in the southwest and northern China.
The Ministry of Water Resources maintains level II emergency response to water and drought disaster prevention.
At the request of the Jiangxi Provincial Defense Office, the State Defense Office and the Ministry of Emergency Management urgently dispatched 20 sets of large-flow professional waterlogging vehicles from Shandong, Jiangsu, Zhejiang Provincial Fire and Rescue Corps and Fujian Longyan Overseas Chinese Emergency Equipment Co., Ltd. to help solve serious disasters such as urban flooding and farmland bubbles caused by heavy rainfall in Jiangxi.
On the 25th, all the equipment had arrived in the front line of flood relief in Jiangxi.
In accordance with the unified dispatch of the local government, Jiangxi Fire and Rescue Bureau of the Ministry of Emergency Management immediately arranged for the Jiangxi Fire and Rescue Corps and the reinforcements of neighboring provinces to set up 20 drainage professional detachments to carry out waterlogging and rescue tasks in the southwest of Jiangchang, Jiujiang and Shangrao.
At the same time, the National Defense Office and the Ministry of Emergency Management also urgently called 100 sets of central reserve flood control material trailer pumping stations to support the flood relief and flood relief work in Jiangxi Province.
Anhui flood control and drought relief headquarters announced that since July 25 at 12 o'clock, Anhui Yangtze River, Huaihe, Chaohu basin related areas into the emergency flood control period.
The Hefei Municipal Disaster Reduction Committee decided to raise the disaster relief emergency response in Hefei to level II at 10 o'clock on July 25.
On July 25, the flood control and drought relief headquarters of Sichuan Province issued the first yellow warning for flash floods after entering the flood this year.
The early warning pointed out that from 20 o'clock on July 25th to 26th at 20 o'clock, Dazhu County in Dazhou City, neighboring Water County in Guang'an City, Meigu County of Liangshan Yi Autonomous Prefecture, Leibo County, Yanning County, Yuexi County, Xide County, Zhaojue County and Jinyang County have a greater possibility of flash floods.
In addition, flash floods may occur in many areas such as Kaijiang County and Dachuan District in Dazhou City.
Jiangsu Provincial Water Conservancy Department changed at 15:30 on July 25 to issue the flood warning of the Nanjing section of the Yangtze River, which was reduced from the red warning to the orange warning; at 10:30, the flood orange warning of the Jiangsu section of Huaihe was upgraded.
At present, there are still 29 rivers (lakes) in Jiangsu, with a total of 44 water levels.
Recently, China's Yangtze River and Huai River Basin have suffered floods, and some of the affected people have been transferred to flood control settlements for temporary housing.
The number of people in the resettlement site is concentrated, the temporary use of fire and electricity has increased, and the risk of fire has increased.
On July 25, the Fire and Rescue Bureau of the Ministry of Emergency Management issued fire safety tips for flood control resettlement sites, calling on management units to implement the main responsibility of fire safety, strengthen safety precautions for the masses, and jointly create a good fire safety environment.
(Integrated reporters Ding Yiting, Wang Hao, Ni Song, Yao Xueqing, Youyi, Wang Yongjie, Zhao Beijia reported)
On July 24th, the on-line iQiyi "The Journey" also embarked on the journey of webcast-Xinhua.com
Directed by Chen Deson and produced by Zheng Baorui, Liu Xianhua, He Rundong, Lin Chenhan, Jiang Zhuxia and other action-adventure films "The Journey" will be launched on July 24.
This is also the second large-scale production film to choose a webcast after "Aunt Mother".
Based on the online game of the same name, "Tradition Road" is based on Qingyuan Village's Young East One Dragon and Chu Jiajun Samurai, and embarking on the journey to participate in the selection of the South Zhao National Military Horse Grand Marshal, encountering King Kong's little sister on the way, and the throuses complete their mission together.
This year is the 15th anniversary of the game's "Journey" IP, and the release of the film of the same name is undoubtedly also a tribute to the classic game.
At the same time of announcing the filing, the film "The Journey" released the "national war" version of the archive poster and the "living" pilot trailer.
The excellent picture quality presents a magnificent picture of national war in the world, depicting the profound fraternity of the two protagonists of Dong Yilong and Chu Soul.
"The Journey" chooses the era of overhead to build the background of the story.
In the fictitious Central Plains continent, among the ten countries, the Southern Zhao Kingdom lives next to Beiyan.
In order to defend against the increasingly powerful Beiyan, Nanzhao held a combat conference and selected talents.
The news reached the remote Qingyuan village, the villager Dong Yilong wanted to become the family's flag man, on behalf of the Qingyuan village family, but the villagers questioned his qualifications, after some efforts, a dragon finally embarked on the journey with the samurai Chu soul.
The total investment of the film is nearly 300 million yuan, and the proportion of special effect lenses is as high as 80%.
As you can imagine, the special effects have become one of the biggest points of the journey.
The post-special effects production team is also quite the beginning, led by MORE VFX, the special effects team that created "Wandering Earth", uses imaginative visual art and top technology to restore the "trouble" world.
Some of these classic game scenes, Phoenix, Qingyuan Village, and Beast Valley will also appear in the movies, and gamers should set off a wave of nostalgia.
In addition to the special effects team, behind-the-scenes production is also a group of accomplished characters in the industry.
Director Chen Desen directed the "October siege", "purple rain storm", the producer Zheng Baorui had filmed "killing the wolf 2", "Western travelogue Sun Wukong three white bone essence", etc., the action scene by the Golden Statue Award and the Golden Horse Award for best action guidance Dong Wei was responsible, the art director Mai Guoqiang is also the winner of the best finger of the two gold medals.
