McDonald's will require customers to wear masks in more than 14,000 stores across the U.S.
In response to the new crown pneumonia epidemic, McDonald's in the United States issued a statement on the 24th that McDonald's stores in the United States have stipulated since August 1 that customers must wear masks at the entrance, and will provide masks at the entrance to guests who have not carried them.
According to NPR, McDonald’s has more than 14,000 stores across the United States.
McDonald's revealed to the media that customers who do not want to wear masks will be guided to takeaway pick-up points that maintain a safe distance from other customers.
In addition, the McDonald's restaurant dining area will also add protective panels to maintain social isolation.
As a result, McDonald’s has introduced a new mask-wearing rule to deal with customers who don’t want to cooperate.
More than 50 repertoires will appear one after another, and Beijing Performance Group will prepare for the resumption of work in the theater - Xinhua.com
With Beijing's emergency public health emergency response level adjusted from the second level to the third level, Beijing's business cultural venues have ushered in the resumption and opening of the current.
Beijing Performing Arts Group revealed that it is fully prepared for the opening of the theater, and more than 50 repertoires will be ready to appear one after another.
Today, Beijing performance group online performance brand - Beijing performance theater will also be online.
During the epidemic period, the hospital group of Jingjing Group "stopped the performance of non-stop 'art', stopped working non-stop 'complets'" to reserve good works.
The Chinese acrobatic troupe will launch "Acrobatic Phantom", "The Treasure of Heaven and Earth" and "The Dream of the Star of the Future" three new repertoires, which will bring together wonderful tricks such as ball technology, ballet opponent's top, pedaling, monopoles, comics, hollow bamboo, and earth circles.
The performance season of the China Evaluation Theatre, "65 years of brilliant history, Qinglian Ya rhyme to create brilliance again" will also kick off, when the three generations of old, middle and young opera bones will perform on the same stage to jointly witness and celebrate the glorious moment of the 65th anniversary of the founding of the hospital.
It is reported that the China Evaluation Theatre currently has a reserve of 30 large-scale theatrical projects and 14 folds, including "Flower Media", "Mother", "Good Night", "Tibet Rainbow", "No Double Legend", "Xinting Tears" and so on.
The Beijing Children's Art Theatre and the Chinese Puppet Theatre, loved by the small audience, have also come up with the ability to "watch the home", waiting to get together with the children again.
The China Puppet Theatre is preparing a large-scale original puppet show "The Great Wall" and a large-scale cartoon stage play "Panda and Little Mole's Little Guardian for Garbage Classification".
Beijing Children's Art Theatre's long-simmering small theater drama "Fourteen Days" has completed the script creation, began to enter the rehearsal stage, plans to premiere at the end of August; the classic IP drama "You look like it is delicious" will be on tour in 12 cities from October to December.
The Beijing Opera and Dance Theatre is also methodically carrying out the re-exhaustion work of 10 high-quality small dances such as "Dream", "Wanma Pentium" and classic songs such as "Song of the New Era", "Love of Beijing" and "Bridge of Love".
It is worth mentioning that the annual work of the Beijing performance group, which will be staged at the end of the year - the musical "In the Distance" is also carrying out rehearsals in an orderly manner.
The Beijing National Orchestra, the Beijing Hebei Zuzi Theatre Troupe, the Beijing opera troupe and the Beijing musical troupe also have a lot of good dramas waiting for the "day when the theater opens".
After the launch of the first online performance season in May, the online performance brand "Beijing Performance Theatre" created by the integration of its nine academies' high-quality performing arts resources was officially launched today.
Beijing Performance Theater aims to create the most complete all-weather online theater of art, among which there are different sections such as "online Huimin performance season" with excellent community and classic programs, as well as different sections such as "Celebrity Talk and Classic Replay", "cloud micro-classroom", "Jing opera, accompanied by Friday".
Today, the Beijing National Orchestra will appear as the first "guester" at the Beijing performance theater, bringing to the audience a "national tide" barrage concert full of creativity and feelings.
All departments actively implement flood control measures to ensure transportation safety
BEIJING, July 26 (Xinhua) -- Since entering the summer, many places in China have been hit by heavy rainfall.
In order to do a good job in summer transport flood control and transportation safety work, all departments adhere to their posts, strengthen the investigation and rectification of hidden dangers, strengthen emergency response, and fully implement various flood control measures.
According to the latest statistics from China National Railway Group Co., Ltd., the railway department has dispatched more than 280,000 inspectors, more than 90,000 bridges, more than 17,000 tunnels, and more than 240,000 culverts.
Since July 1st, the country's major railway trunk lines and freight channels have maintained safe and unimpeded, and the overall transportation order has been good, and the cross-railway bureau has reached 97.7%, 87.1% and 86.8%, respectively.
China Railway Nanchang Bureau Group Co., Ltd. dispatching office to strengthen emergency response, the designated person is responsible for dynamic tracking of flood control tools, road material reserves and storage situation, in the event of sudden disaster failure, rapid notification of information, start emergency response.
Recently, in the face of heavy rainfall leading to the formation of the upper reaches to form a security threat caused by the Yiwan Railway Qingjiang Bridge, China Railway Wuhan Bureau Group Co., Ltd. organized professional and technical personnel 24 hours to monitor the Qingjiang Bridge, and established an all-weather communication mechanism with local emergency departments to grasp and deal with hidden dangers in a timely manner.
In order to ensure the safety of electricity transportation in the summer, the national network of Qingdao, that ink district power supply company combined with the climatic characteristics of the flood season, in close cooperation with the local meteorological and railway departments, to strengthen the railway power supply lines and facilities and equipment within the jurisdiction of the inspection and investigation of hidden dangers, and to strengthen the emergency treatment of landslides, landslides, mudslides and other related accidents in the line corridors.
In order to further improve the work of flood control and prevention, Eastern Aviation Technology Co., Ltd. set up an emergency rescue reserve team to carry out flood prevention and disaster prevention knowledge training, and according to the daily weather and typhoon and other early warning conditions, the development of flight plans, the coastal suspension aircraft before the operation of the preparation and related emergency plans.
