Yesterday, there were more clouds in the sky in Beijing, and the maximum temperature in most parts of the city in the afternoon exceeded 33 °C, and the humidity increased compared with the previous few days, and the sweltering feeling increased.
With the arrival of cold air, the rain will return to Beijing.
It is expected that during today's day, Beijing is cloudy, there are scattered showers (accompanided by weak lightning), the south wind has two or three four degrees, with a maximum temperature of 29 °C; at night, there is small to moderate rain (accompanied by weak lightning), the south-to-north wind is one or two, and the minimum temperature is 23 °C.
There will still be thunderstorms in Beijing tomorrow, with a maximum temperature of 30 °C.
Experts reminded that today and tomorrow more rainy weather, go out with rain gear, pay attention to lightning and rain and traffic safety, try to avoid mountain activities, prevent geological disasters.
Heilongjiang carries out special actions to clean up and rectification under the name of well-known hospitals-Zhongxin.com
In recent years, the names of some medical institutions have been irregular and unsuitable, and the names of well-known medical institutions have been misused without authorization according to law to mislead the people to seek medical treatment.
After querying the national enterprise credit information publicity system, some of the registered medical institutions in Heilongjiang Province have some of the words of well-known medical institutions such as "Conference", and use the names of well-known hospitals such as "concordation" to carry out operations, disrupting the normal medical order, resulting in bad social impact.
At the same time, we will take this as an opportunity to carry out various forms of legal publicity activities to improve the sense of responsibility of market entities, the awareness of rights protection in accordance with the law, and the awareness of law-abiding management.
By unblocking complaints and reporting channels, a number of typical cases with bad effects have been publicly exposed to the public, resulting in a deterrent effect.
30 e-sports projects settled, Shanghai Pudong to expand online new economic "new track" - Xinhua
Xinhua News Agency, Shanghai, July 25 (Reporter Teng Jianyi) 24, 30 key esports projects landed in Shanghai Pudong New Area, from venues, events to enterprises, covering the development of the eSports industry in the whole category, is expected to drive the regional esports game industry to add tens of billions of yuan of revenue.
The digital cultural industry represented by eSports games will become a new growth point for Pudong's online new economy, helping Shanghai to build a global e-sports capital.
In terms of esports venues, on the basis of the existing top event venues such as the Mei Ben Cultural Center and the Oriental Sports Center, a new batch of venues such as Pudong Football Stadium, the professional esports sports space, and the Dongchang game space have confirmed the landing of Pudong.
Wang Haisong, general manager of Shanghai Waigaoqiao Group, told reporters that that about 1,500 square meters of indoor venues can accommodate 1,000 people, is currently under construction, is expected to introduce the event in March next year, the eSports hall will be equipped with 120,000 square meters of greening park, combined with e-sports pan-entertainment format, the introduction of anime two-dimensional and other entertainment elements.
In terms of e-sports supporting industries, Pudong strives to improve the layout of the industrial chain.
NetEase Dragon team and other world champion teams in the signing activities settled debut, the country's only game e-sports TV digital channel - the development of Pudong.
In terms of events, Pudong actively strives for the landing of top international and domestic events, and creates an e-competition season that does not end.
A number of e-competition events such as the 2020 Peace Elite International Champions Cup and La Liga E-sports have been announced to be held in Pudong.
In terms of enterprises, Pudong focuses on promoting the landing of head enterprises.
For example, if the original information plans to launch dozens of game products in Pudong, NetEase Blizzard, Perfect World, and Fun Games will also actively launch new projects and strive to form tens of billions of yuan of revenue.
According to statistics, Pudong's e-sports game industry accounts for one-third of Shanghai's.
Tencent, NetEase and a number of eSports game head enterprises landed in Pudong, TI9, the king's glory winter race and a number of top events held in Pudong, Pudong is becoming the "strong heart" of the development of Shanghai eSports industry.
The gathering of high-quality e-sports industry in Pudong is also inseparable from the support of relevant policies.
Recently, the China Game Industry Research Institute landed in Pudong to develop high-standard norms for the industry.
Pudong's star vocational schools have been licensed as "Shanghai Vocational Education E-sports Professional Pilot School", laying the foundation for the training of talents in the e-sports industry.
The registration system of e-sports athletes has taken the lead in landing in Pudong, further improving the professionalization level of e-sports players.
Huang Wei, director of the Cultural and Sports Tourism Bureau of Pudong New Area, said that around the goal of creating a "global e-sports capital" in Shanghai, Pudong proposed the construction of a "core functional area for the development of Shanghai's esports industry".
In the next step, Pudong will continue to focus on key events and key enterprises, accelerate development and form an industrial chain.
Using the policies of the Shanghai Pilot Free Trade Zone to improve the overall development of the e-sports industry, explore innovation first, and form a replicable experience that can be promoted.
The first spectators of the Capital Theater will meet the epidemic tomorrow - Xinhua
At 2 p.m. tomorrow, Beijing People's Art will release the classic "The Death of a Salesman" script to read aloud, ushering in a long-lost audience at the Capital Theater.
Under the premise of "adhering to normal prevention and control, orderly opening up, and booking restrictions on circulation", Beijing people's art will strictly implement personnel reservation limit measures to ensure that the total number of spectators does not exceed 30% of the number of seats in the theater, and ensure that the spectators sit and maintain a distance of more than 1 meter.
At the same time, the theater has also made sufficient preparations in terms of daily duty, cleaning and disinfection, detection and registration, garbage cleaning, site inspection, and safety management.
This event is only open to the audience of the entity membership card of the Friends of the Holders, and due to the limited flow requirements, each person is limited to one order, until it is full.
On the day of the performance, the subscriber must hold the original identity card and the performance ticket, wear a mask, and maintain an orderly check at a distance of more than 1 meter.
It is necessary to wear a mask throughout the performance and try to avoid direct conversations.
"The Death of a Salesman" is a masterpiece of the famous screenwriter Arthur Miller, and since its completion in 1949, it has had a broad reputation around the world.
In the 1980s, under the mediation of Ying Ruocheng and others, Arthur Miller came to China and rehearsed his own work for Beijing people's art.
This script reading is composed entirely of the young actors in Beijing, under the leadership of the director Tang Ye carried out two weeks of rehearsals, everyone created a small portrait to analyze the characters in depth, in order to be able in nearly 40 years, after re-examination, so that this realistic drama rejuvenated the charismatic light.
Today, the opening ceremony of the 2020 Hunan Red Tourism and Culture Festival and the first Red Culture Industry Expo in Xiangtan were held in Shaoshan.
The Standing Committee of the Provincial Party Committee and Zhang Hongsen, Minister of Propaganda of the Provincial Party Committee, announced the opening of the Red Tourism and Culture Festival, and Deputy Governor Wu Guiying delivered a speech.
Hunan Red Tourism and Culture Festival has been successfully held for 16 sessions and is a well-known brand of national red tourism.
The festival is co-sponsored by the Propaganda Department of the Provincial Party Committee, the Provincial Department of Culture and Tourism, and the Xiangtan Municipal Party Committee and Municipal Government.
Wu Guiying said that the holding of this festival is of great significance for the implementation of General Secretary Xi Jinping's important instructions to make good use of red resources, carry forward the red tradition, and inherit the red genes, further grasp the development of red tourism in our province, promote the recovery of the cultural tourism market, and let the "red forces" condense into a broad joint effort to build a rich, beautiful and happy new Hunan.
To carry forward the red culture, inherit the red spirit, stimulate cultural tourism consumption, and promote the high-quality development of Hunan cultural tourism, it will certainly play a more positive role in promoting it.
At the opening ceremony, the two activities of "Red and Rongxiang · Praise China" Red Dance Invitational Competition and "Re-walking the Long March Road and Crossing the Xiang Gan Side" were launched at the same time.
During the festival, there will also be activities such as the promotion and signing ceremony of Xiangtan Industrial Project Investment Promotion and Signing, the Red Tourism Five Good Interpreters Forum and the Red Education and Training Seminar, the Red Smart Cultural Tourism Experience Exhibition and the sharing of new technologies, and the "Xiangshui homogenous origin and cultural roots" Hunan Mountain Song Invitational Competition.
During the opening ceremony, leaders and guests such as Zhang Hongsen and Wu Guiying went to Xiangtan's first Red Culture and Industry Exposition and watched the live performance of "China's Mao Zedong".
Qinghai Lake "Huanhai live room": "sweet" with goods to help farmers to increase income-Zhongxin.com
2020-07-26 19:43:50 Source:chinanews.com Author:su yiyu Responsibility Editor:su yiyu
Wu Na (left), president of Beijing Houdeli Bee Industry Co., Ltd., introduces Qinghai bee products.
Ma Ming's speech
Sino-Singapore network Qinghai Hainan July 26th topic: Qinghai Lake on the shores of the "flower sea live room": "sweet" with goods to help farmers increase their income
Written by Hu Guilong Pan Yujie.
"Summing summer Qinghai Lake, full of golden flowers, thousands of bees flying, where the altitude is high, the temperature difference between day and night, less air pollution, strong light has given birth to the most tenacious and generous bee group, creating the characteristics of high activity, high protein, rich in nutritional value, and low sugar and low fat."
On the 26th, Zhang Jianxun, deputy director of the Industry and Information Administration Bureau of Hainan Tibetan Autonomous Prefecture in Qinghai Province, said.
On the same day, the "communicating war epidemic spring pastry to help farmers" bee products live delivery activities were held on the shores of Qinghai Lake, and representatives of the China Bee Products Association and entrepreneurs, beehivers and other parties gathered to jointly promote Qinghai's characteristic bee products, with a total of nearly 10,000 bottles of Qinghai Plateau royal jelly sold online and offline, with a total of nearly 3.8 million yuan.
Pictured is the beehive farmer's on-site display of bee products.
It is reported that the live delivery activities with the help of Beijing Houdeli bee business chain network, fast hand, Taobao and other domestic well-known bee products retail enterprises, live broadcast, e-commerce platform, to promote the "enterprise + bee farmers + growers" exchanges and cooperation, and through online and offline channels to continue to issue "Qinghai Plateau spring pulp consumer vouchers", it is expected that the total amount of profits of the enterprise throughout the year nearly 5.28 million yuan.
In this regard, Wu Na, president of Beijing Hudley Bee Industry Co., Ltd., believes that "it is worth it": "This move can expand the popularity of Qinghai bee products, attract more consumers to understand, like to add no natural bee products, and drive bee farmers to increase their income."
At present, the company has signed a production cooperation strategic agreement with Qinghai Cloud Bee Industry Co., Ltd. and Qinghai Huabao Bee Industry Co., Ltd. to jointly promote the long-term development of the local bee industry in Qinghai.
Pictured is the sea of canola flowers on the shores of Qinghai Lake.
This spring, due to the epidemic prevention and control needs to set up road traffic levels, bee farmers "chasing honey" road is blocked, many bees due to missed the flowering period, lack of food and died, bee farmers income has been seriously affected.
"At the end of the year, the bee farmers followed the long journey of the flowering period, moving all the way from Yunnan and Sichuan to the north to the northwest region, and they were sleeping well, living without a place, and it was very hard."
As businesses, we have a responsibility to help them.”
Wu Na said.
"Little bees are 'environmental scouts', and bees in heavily polluting areas can't survive." Zhao Xiaochuan, executive vice president of the China Bee Products Association, introduced that bee pollination is an important part of the ecological chain, which plays an irreplaceable role in protecting the diversity of plants and improving the ecological environment.
At the same time, bee pollination can increase crop yields and improve quality, especially in areas with poor management conditions, the significance of pollination is greater.
According to the research data, pollination can increase canola production by about 15%-30%.
Zhao Xiaochuan (right), executive vice president of the China Bee Products Association, introduced Qinghai bee products.
“The economic, ecological and social benefits created by bee pollination are much greater than the value of bee products themselves, and the bee industry has great potential for human health, crop production, vegetation reproduction, and ecological protection, and little has always been known about it.”
Zhao Xiaochuan said.
Nowadays, there are fewer and fewer beekeepers, in addition to beehive farmers who run around all year round, there are still many poor households with limited mobility who choose to invest in cooperatives with beehives.
"The state has financial support, we contact technical personnel to help guide, bee farmers lack understanding and judgment of the market environment, to open sales also need the help and coordination of the government, enterprises, industry associations."
Zhao Xiaochuan said.
"I hope that you will pay more attention in the future to help the beekeepers," Wu Na said, "our bee products are also screened and controlled in strict accordance with national standards to ensure quality and protect the rights and interests of consumers while helping bee farmers."
Affected by continuous rainfall, since July 22nd, Chongqing Wulong District Land Township Liujing Village Zhongtai group in the middle of the fort landslide after the soil cracking, there is a large-scale landslide deformation, completely blocked along the Cang River, the formation of the dam before the water level of 13 meters, estimated reservoir capacity of about 550,000 cubic meters of the cysantery body.
In order to ensure the safety of navigation, the Chongqing maritime department decided to implement temporary traffic control on the waters from the Yangtze River to Guanyin Beach.
According to the monitoring of Chongqing Meteorological and Hydrological Department, since the 25th, there has been widespread moderate to heavy rain in the central and western and northeastern regions of Chongqing, heavy rain in some areas, and heavy rain in local areas.
Lianjiang Xiaoheba Station will have the highest water level on the evening of the 26th, and the highest water level will be close to the alert level.
In order to ensure the safety of navigation, the Chongqing maritime department decided to implement temporary traffic control on the waters from the Yangtze River to Guanyin Beach.
After the Chongqing Municipal Defense Office and meteorological, water conservancy, hydrology and other departments and units of the emergency consultation and judgment, the Chongqing flood control and drought relief headquarters decided to issue river flood level III early warning information, start flood control level IV emergency response.
According to the requirements of the Chongqing flood control and drought relief headquarters, the relevant member units of Chongqing Jiangbei, Shapingba, Tongnan, Wulong and other counties and the relevant member units of the Chongqing defense index should pay great attention to the rain situation, especially the changes in the Yangtze River, Jialing River and Wujiang River, analyze and judge in advance, issue early warning, strengthen the patrol, resolutely and decisively evacuate the people in the threatened areas, mobilize emergency rescue teams and materials in a timely manner, quickly and efficiently.
Representatives of the Minister Counsellor of the Vietnamese Embassy in Laos, the Vietnamese Buddhist Association in Laos, the Association of Vietnamese People in Laos, representatives of the Vientiane Provincial Government, and the Lao Veterans Association participated in the commemoration ceremony.
The ceremony was held in a solemn and solemn atmosphere, and the delegates successively incensed to the heroes and paid tribute to the great achievements of the heroes and the special unity of the Vietnamese and the elderly.
In his speech, Minister Counsellor Zheng Shixin said that this is an opportunity for the Vietnamese people and the Lao people to pay tribute to the revolutionary heroes of the two countries and to express their gratitude for the heroic sacrifices for the independence and freedom of the two countries, and it is also a good opportunity for the two peoples to review the joint efforts between the two countries to fight against common enemies, strive for national independence, national unity, jointly build national development, and consolidate bilateral relations.
Seventy-four years ago, on January 23, 1946, 28 fighters of the Lao-Vietnamese Fighting League were heroically sacrificed while attacking the Phonehe stronghold.
The victory of this offensive has become a historic victory between the two countries in the early stages of the revolutionary struggle for national liberation.
Ms. Zheng Shixin stressed that the two peoples will always bear in mind the heroes who died for the cause of the national liberation struggle of the two countries, and stressed that the young areas of the two countries will continue to carry forward the heroic and strong traditions of their predecessors and make due contributions to the continuous flowering of Vietnam-Vietnam relations and the prosperity and development of the two countries.
