Inter Unlock 3000th Serie A Match - Sino-Singapore
Beijing time on the morning of the 26th, Serie A traditional giants Inter ushered in a landmark battle.
According to Italian media statistics, the away match against Genoa is the 3000th Serie A in the history of Inter Milan, and the Nerazzurri is also the first team to unlock this milestone.
Since the 1929 league transition, Inter have been the only team that has never been absent from Serie A and the only one that has never been relegated.
According to Italian media reports, the match between Inter and Genoa is the 3000th game in the history of the blue and black army team.
In this landmark battle, Inter defeated Genoa with three goals away.
In this campaign, Lukakumei opened twice, and Sanchez, who came on the bench, also contributed a goal.
From the beginning of the game into the rhythm of Inter Milan, the strike was finally converted into a goal in the 34th minute.
Biragi left pass, Lukaku in the middle of the bag to break the goal.
In the 82nd minute, Inter made the same way, Moses broke through on the right side of the pass, Sánch Sanchez's middle road bag was pushed and pushed; Lukaku completed Mei Kai two times before the end of the game, counter-attacking Brozovic sent a long-distance straight stop, Lukaku broke into the penalty area and waved Romero and pushed the empty goal score, the score was fixed at 3:0.
Inter's 3-0 victory over Genoa, the points against Atlanta rose to No. 2, in the case of a multi-match situation behind the leader Juventus 4 points, still retains the hope of winning the championship.
At this point, in the 3,000 Serie A games that spanned nearly 90 years, Inter won 1,489 of them, drew 834 games, and lost 677 games, with a win rate of 49.6%.
Among them, the team scored a total of 5,038 goals and conceded 3,102 goals, averaging 1.68 goals per game.
The Nerazzurri won the league 18 times and was never relegated.
