The old face of the spy war drama Liu Yunlong performed a stammering male protagonist - Xinhua.com
Produced by Liu Yunlong and directed by Yin Fei, Liu Yunlong, Su Qing, Liang Guanhua, Li Liqun and other large-scale spy war drama "Winning" landed in Guangdong Satellite TV's "Vibrant Theater" at 7:30 p.m. on July 16.
The play tells the story of Tang Fei, an underground member of the Communist Party of China lurking in the pseudo-police department of Japan (Liu Yunlong), in conjunction with Soviet agents, to assassinate the leader of Japanese agents and crush the shocking conspiracy of the Japanese army.
Based on historical facts, the material is taken from Soviet military archives that have been sealed for many years.
During the defense of Moscow, the Soviet Red Army's Far East advanced to the west, and at this time, the "Northern March" of the Japanese Kwantung Army believed that there was an opportunity to take advantage and intended to send troops.
In order to solve the enemy's danger, the CCP, together with the intelligence personnel of the Communist Party of the Soviet Union, implemented the "Mudanula" plan.
According to this historical background, the well-known screenwriter Deng Yuan has been polished several times, so that the plot twists and turns.
Liu Yunlong is currently working as a producer and male protagonist in "Success".
In the play, he plays Tang Fei, who is the head of the Criminal Section of the Linhe Police Department, and is a stammering policeman who is very happy and even a little discouraged, and his real identity is an underground member of the Communist Party of China.
Instead, Cai Meng, the heroine who staged the opponent's drama, is the section chief of the Linhe Security Bureau, which is deeply appreciated by the Japanese boss Fukuhara, and there is a delicate relationship with Tang Fei, which is also hostile and friendly and ambiguous.
In recent years, Su Qing has experimented with many different types of characters, from Lu Ruowen in "Those Years We Are Young" to Erqing in "Yellow Jubilee Raiders", which left a deep impression on the audience and was recognized for acting.
Suqing and Liu Yunlong is the first partner, stammering sheriff with cheesy female police settings, quite interesting and innovative.
In addition to the two protagonists, there are many powerful actors such as Liang Guanhua, Li Liqun, Qian Bo, Lei Han, and Shen Junyi in the "Winning", which is also one of the highlights of the show.
It is understood that the production of "Winning" is also very good, and the crew spans nearly 2,000 kilometers across Jiangsu, Zhejiang and Liaoning provinces.
In order to restore the strange urban style of the northeast period, the theater team's art prop group rushed to work day and night, carefully polished every detail of the scene construction and props, so that the scene picture in the drama is exquisite, full of historical texture.
Floods in two western Yemen provinces leave 16 dead
Xinhua News Agency, Kuwait City, July 26 (Reporter Nie Yunpeng Wang Wei) Sanaa news: According to local media reports in Yemen on the 26th, heavy rainfall has occurred in the western Yemeni provinces of Hodeidah and Hajj provinces, and the floods have killed at least 16 people in the past 48 hours.
According to reports, floods caused by rains in Hodeidah Province killed 13 people, and three people were killed in the floods in neighboring Hajj province.
In addition, dozens of houses in the northern province of Hodeidah and in the southern part of Hajj have been destroyed by flooding, and some roads and farmland have also been damaged to varying degrees.
Years of military conflict have caused Yemen’s near-collapse of its health system.
According to statistics from the United Nations Office for the Coordination of Humanitarian Affairs, the number of people infected with cholera in Yemen has exceeded 1 million since 2017, and the number of deaths has exceeded 2,000.
Medical facilities in Yemen are concerned that the ongoing flooding will cause the cholera epidemic to spread again.
"Jedi attack" release of the battle boxing dream life - Xinhua.com
It is directed by the young director, and the online film "Jedi Attack" starring Liao William, Dongyu, Yang Xinzhen, Wang Yibo, etc. is officially released in iQiyi.
The film tells the story of the fallen boxer Venus returning to the fisting table and fights for dignity, showing a blood-stained journey of dreams.
The film "Jedi Attack" with Thailand as the main plot to promote, the "May Thai boxing" as the starting point of the dream, the whole story is carried out under the adaptation of traditional Chinese cultural values, whether it is Venus in the early days for the master's determination, or in the later support of friends and lovers to rejuvenate as a struggle for dignity, are showing the traditional Chinese culture of men's pursuit of family and dreams and great love.
Combined with the classic Hollywood sports film story mode and the strong combination of the professional teams of China and Thailand, "Jedi Attack" not only presents the effect of internationalization, but also will impress different types of audiences.
At the same time, "Jedi Attack" shows a large number of Muay Thai fights and training plots, the fierceness of the scene and warm blood.
In the film, Zhang Xiaoliang, a game designer played by Dongyu, helps Venus played by Liao William to return to the boxing table and take off the laurel's plot, combining the novel high-tech and high-bloody competitive competitions, and also showing Zhang Xiaoliang and Venus's seemingly "different" and practical goals.
In addition, the long-flowing love between Venus and the crystal is also very touching, Jingjing's silent support for Venus and Venus's firm commitment to the crystal, which allows the audience to see the "iron man's tenderness" on Venus, and also adds a lot of feelings to the fallen champion.
