As a result of the epidemic, people began to spend more time on the Internet.”
Marinichev did not rule out a serious increase in Internet prices each year, arguing that operators could offer customers higher speeds and more services to offset people's dissatisfaction with price increases.
"Chinese doctors" praising anti-epidemic heroes - Xinhua
Recently, with the respect of the heroes of the Chinese filmmakers against the epidemic, the chairman of Bona Film Group, and Liu Weiqiang (pictured left) held discussions and exchanges on the shooting and production of the anti-epidemic film "Chinese Doctor" in Guangzhou and Zhong Nanshan.
Bona Pictures hopes that through "Chinese Doctors", we can pay tribute to all the medical care and epidemic prevention workers who are fighting in the front line of epidemic prevention and control!
In 2021, the film will be released nationwide as a tribute film celebrating the 100th anniversary of the founding of the Communist Party of China.
At present, Bona Film is under the arrangement and deployment of the Central Propaganda Department and the National Film Bureau, with the support of the Guangdong Provincial Film Bureau and the Hubei Provincial Film Bureau, organized the original team of the film "Chinese captain" to make the film "Chinese doctor", which is a film reflected under the strong leadership of the Party Central Committee, and the people of the whole country are united to fight against the new crown pneumonia epidemic.
The film focuses on the first line of anti-epidemic in Wuhan, and will use the Wuhan medical staff and provincial and municipal medical teams as the background, from the perspective of humanity, the use of unique narratives, as well as the impact of the lens language, the panorama shows the touching story of Chinese medical staff full of dedication and sacrifice in the first line of anti-epidemic.
It is understood that in the first day of Wuhan's unsealing day, Bona company overcame many difficulties, sent a shooting team deep into the first line of the epidemic, and hundreds of health care workers face-to-face exchange understanding and collection of information, has been interviewed, including Zhong Nanshan academician himself, the first person in Guangzhou, the first person in Guangdong, as well as Wuhan Jinyintan Hospital, Wuhan Union Hospital, Wuhan University Zhongnan Hospital, Wuhan Central Hospital and other anti-epidemic front of the most cutting-edged white-clad angels.
Academician Zhong Nanshan also put forward expectations and hopes for the shooting of the film in this symposium: "I look forward, I hope that you will not only visit some of the experts with more appearances, but also interview more medical personnel who work hard in the front line, they are the majority."
He said that he had seen "me and my motherland" and "Chinese captain" before, and believed that the method of telling the story of the big pattern from the perspective of ordinary people was very good.
“There are still some misunderstandings about China by some foreign friends.”
Referring to the spread of the film, academician Zhong Nanshan said that at present, some people in foreign countries like to label the virus as politicized, and he hopes that the film can impress the audience from the perspective of humanity: "In addition to the screening of the film in China, it is best to be screened in foreign countries, and it is necessary to impress the audience with a real humanistic spirit in a way that can be understood by domestic and foreign audiences."
Academician Zhong Nanshan also fondly recalled the 1980s film "people to middle age", "so many years have passed, after the reform and opening up after the film is the most impressive is "people to the middle age", when my foreign doctors and friends are crying, if "Chinese doctor" can play such a role, it will be remarkable."
Academician Zhong Nanshan said that if "Chinese Doctor" can resonate with foreign audiences, it will be very successful.
During the discussion and exchange, academician Zhong Nanshan also shared his comments and suggestions on the current international epidemic prevention and control, "I believe that people will always be smarter than the virus."
Academician Zhong Nanshan said that although the virus is difficult to predict, but from the primitive society so far, human beings have overcome thousands of risks, and now modern society has developed medical technology and social management measures, coupled with the world's medical staff, and even ordinary people have a basic understanding of scientific response to the new crown pneumonia epidemic, people will no longer be as passive as before, "the next thing to pay attention to two aspects of work, one is to study how to strengthen cooperation around the world, the second is to pay attention to the comfort of people."
(Reporter Wang Jinyue)
"Red Fruits" Ju Shaoshan - Xiangtan's First Red Bo Meeting - Today's News - Hunan Daily Network - Huasheng Online
Hunan Daily · New Hunan client reporter 蒋睿 Correspondent Xiao Yan
